7d'}, {'abstract': 'The Mets hypothesized that pitching to Cespedes would require so much attention from opponents that their other batters would benefit. Lucas Duda hit behind Cespedes on Saturday, and crushed two home runs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/02/sports/baseball/mets-yoenis-cespedes-makes-his-presence-felt-indirectly-in-a-win.html', 'snippet': 'The Mets hypothesized that pitching to Cespedes would require so much attention from opponents that their other batters would benefit. Lucas Duda hit behind Cespedes on Saturday, and crushed two home runs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Citi Field crowd leapt from its seats and threw up its hands and roared in anticipation, watching a screaming line drive jump off Yoenis Cespedes’s bat. The second-largest crowd in the park’s history, 42,996 fans, had come to watch his Mets debut. He had been heralded as their offensive savior, and a home run would tie the score in the sixth inning. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/02/sports/METS/METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/02/sports/METS/METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/02/sports/METS/METS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/02/sports/METS/METS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1557, 'width': 1038, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/02/sports/METS/METS-thumbStan