o sang Rossini’s beguiling phrases with soft yet penetrating richness, subtly folding ornaments and runs into the long melodic arcs. And Mr. Mariotti drew hushed gentle and transparent playing from the inspired Met orchestra.” ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s On TV Sunday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What&#8217;s On TV Sunday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-02T15:46:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/3d1f8ee8-229c-59bf-be1f-0e99a82fbe98', 'word_count': 657, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3d1f8ee8-229c-59bf-be1f-0e99a82fbe98'}, {'abstract': 'After publicly embracing sick leave, the owner of Bombay Sandwich Company did not pay an ill employee for a missed workday in January.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/03/nyregion/poster-child-for-new-yorks-paid-sick-leave-law-failed-to-follow-it.html', 'snippet': 'After publicly embracing sick leave, the owner of Bombay Sandwich Company did not pay an ill employee for a missed workday in January.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shiv Puri embraced New York City’s paid sick leave law last year and was heralded as a trailblazer among employers. At City Hall, Mayor Bill de Blasio praised him as “a great example to business owners all across the city.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20