://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/03/sports/year-after-heartbreak-happiness-in-the-stable-and-the-cradle.html', 'snippet': 'A devastating scratch at 2014’s Kentucky Derby was followed by a run of luck that led to American Pharoah’s Triple Crown victory, another racer’s successful return and the arrival of an unexpected bundle of joy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OCEANPORT, N.J. — It was late May, and a little more than a week stood between American Pharoah and his date with destiny in the Belmont Stakes. The morning media crush had dissipated at Bob Baffert’s barn at Churchill Downs in Kentucky, where the colt, the Kentucky Derby and Preakness Stakes champion, was free from the crowd already assembling at Belmont Park in New York. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/03/sports/03RACING1/03RACING1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/03/sports/03RACING1/03RACING1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/03/sports/03RACING1/03RACING1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/03/sports/03RACING1/03RACING1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1106, 'width': 1660, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/03/sports/03RACING1/03RACING1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/03/sports/03RACING1/03RACING1-thumbStandard.jpg', '