': 'AT&T Says Users Can Watch TV on Any Device With Its New Bundle, the First of Its Kind ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'AT&amp;T Says Users Can Watch TV on Any Device With Its New Bundle, the First of Its Kind ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AT&T Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DirecTV', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wireless Communications', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-03T04:01:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emily Steel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emily', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Steel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/99c6c0f0-df4c-5d14-be91-604404ceaa6a', 'word_count': 413, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99c6c0f0-df4c-5d14-be91-604404ceaa6a'}, {'abstract': 'In some children, finicky eating habits may be part of a more complicated psychological story.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/03/picky-eating-in-children-linked-to-anxiety-depression-and-a-d-h-d/', 'snippet': 'In some children, finicky eating habits may be part of a more complicated psychological story.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the last several months, my 3-year-old daughter Annika has been on a steady diet of waffles, yogurt sticks and milk. Before that, she ate mainly hot dogs and milk. And for many months before that, she ate almost nothing but fruit-and-yogurt squeezers and, you guessed it, milk. While I haven’t exactly been thrilled with her eating habits, I recognize that in life, and in parenting, we need to pick our battles. And the food battle is one I had chosen not to fight in full force. I had purposefully avoided putting too much pressure on Annika to eat a wider variety of foods because I thought that might backfire and make things worse. I also figured she would branch out eventually, as my older daughter had. But a new study, published in the journal Pediatrics, made me wonder if I should rethink my strategy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/03/us/motherlode-picky2/motherlode-picky2-articleLarge.png', 'height': 809, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/03/us/motherlode-picky2/motherlode-picky2-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 809}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/03/us/motherlode-picky2/motherlode-picky2-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 760, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/03/us/motherlode-picky2/motherlode-picky2-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1348, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/03/us/motherlode-picky2/motherlode-picky2-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/03/us/motherlode-picky2/motherlode-picky2-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/03/us/motherlode-picky2/mo