 a law school friend of Bill Clinton.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/04/business/db-consulting-web1/db-consulting-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/04/business/db-consulting-web1/db-consulting-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/04/business/db-consulting-web1/db-consulting-web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/04/business/db-consulting-web1/db-consulting-web1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1322, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/04/business/db-consulting-web1/db-consulting-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/04/business/db-consulting-web1/db-consulting-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/04/business/db-consulting-web1/db-consulting-web1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Regulator Moves to Suspend Promontory Financial', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Promontory Consulting Is Suspended by New York', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Promontory Financial Group', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Department of Financial Services (NYS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Albanese, Anthony J (1971- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lawsky, Benjamin M', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ludwig, Eugene A', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-03T12:59:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Protess and Jessica Silver-Greenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Protess', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Jessica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silver-Greenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/06b52faa-feac-5784-a306-8f38f012d836', 'word_count': 1358, 'uri': 'nyt://article/06b52faa-feac-5784-a306-8f38f012d836'}, {'abstract': 'The largest of the wildfires is the Rocky Fire, which has burned 60,000 acres and spread to three counties in Northern California.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/04/us/california-wildfires-rocky-fire.html', 'snippet': 'The largest of the wildfires is the Rocky Fire, which has burned 60,000 acres and spread to three counties in Northern California.', 'lead_paragraph': 'National Guard forces dropped water along the edges of a raging wildfire over the weekend as more than 2,000 firefighters in Northern California tried to contain a blaze that has already scorched 60,000 acres.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Crews in California Fight to Contain 21 Wildfires', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wildfires', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-03T13:00:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Hauser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hauser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/433cc438-4b8b-5527-84a4-d5485d6d4e3b', 'word_count': 297, 'uri': 'nyt://article/433cc438-4b8b-5527-84a4-d5485d6d4e3b'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Gremillet will succeed Gary Hanson, who has spent 27 years with the Cleveland Orchestra. The orchestra said that the two men would begin working together on the transition in October.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/03/cleveland-orchestra-announces-andr-gremillet-as-its-next-executive-director/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Gremillet will succeed Gary Hanson, who has spent 27 years with the Cleveland Orchestra. The orchestra said that the two men would begin working together on the transition in October.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Another major American orchestra has turned to Melbourne, Australia, for leadership: the Cleveland Orchestra announced Monday that its next executive director would be André Gremillet, who is currently the managing director of the Melbourne Symphony Orchestra.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, '