winners, who went on to win 92 races in 162 more starts. Pharoah may race two or three more times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'American Pharoah won the Haskell Invitational with ease Sunday. He was a 1-9 favorite and is the reigning Triple Crown winner, so few were surprised. He may race two or three more times at the most, then he will be retired. Few are surprised by that decision either.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'American Pharoah Steers Clear of Route of Past Triple Crown Winners', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'American Pharoah (Race Horse)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Triple Crown (Horse Racing)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-03T14:53:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Victor Mather', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Victor', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mather', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd42ae51-dea3-5104-8cec-9e534044745a', 'word_count': 457, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd42ae51-dea3-5104-8cec-9e534044745a'}, {'abstract': 'Should he seek political asylum, Ling Wancheng, the brother of a former top Chinese government official, could be one of the most damaging defectors in China’s history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/04/world/asia/china-seeks-ling-wancheng-businessman-said-to-have-fled-to-us.html', 'snippet': 'Should he seek political asylum, Ling Wancheng, the brother of a former top Chinese government official, could be one of the most damaging defectors in China’s history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOOMIS, Calif. — China is demanding that the Obama administration return a w