ps://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/04/the-selfless-lei-feng-is-back-as-a-magazine/', 'snippet': 'The publication celebrates the altruistic spirit of a soldier who became a propaganda icon in the 1960s, in part to counter critics who question some of the actions attributed to him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lei Feng may be dead, but he lives on in print. The selfless soldier who became a propaganda icon in 1960s China has been revived in a cramped office in western Beijing, where a new monthly magazine supervised by the Communist Party’s People’s Publishing House was started in July.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/05/world/04sino-lei02/04sino-lei02-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/05/world/04sino-lei02/04sino-lei02-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/05/world/04sino-lei02/04sino-lei02-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/05/world/04sino-lei02/04sino-lei02-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1537, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/05/world/04sino-lei02/04sino-lei02-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/05/world/04sino-lei02/04sino-lei02-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'imag