ed on the water before exploding.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/05/world/europe/les-munro-dambusters-pilot-dies.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Munro, a New Zealander, took part in raids on heavily fortified dams in Germany in 1943, using bombs that bounced on the water before exploding.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the night of May 16, 1943, a squadron of bombers set out from Britain to conduct strikes against heavily fortified dams in the Ruhr Valley of Germany, using bombs that bounced on the water before exploding. Of the 133 crew members who started the mission, only 77 returned.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/05/world/05munro-3-obit-web/05munro-3-obit-web-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/05/world/05munro-3-obit-web/05munro-3-obit-web-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/05/world/05munro-3-obit-web/05munro-3-obit-web-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 577, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/05/world/05munro-3-obit-web/05munro-3-obit-web-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 1239, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/05/world/05munro-3-obit-web/05munro-3-obit-web-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/05/world/05munro-3-obit-web/05munro-3-obit-web-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidt