ioning tourists.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/times-insider/2015/08/04/refugee-crisis-on-the-beach-in-greece/', 'snippet': 'The foreign correspondent Suzanne Daley reports on the scene in Lesbos, Greece, where thousands of migrants have washed up on shores popular with vacationing tourists.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Refugee camps are always sad, desperate places. I saw a lot of them when I was covering southern Africa for four years. But most were in desolate, poor places, not vacation islands like Lesbos, Greece, where thousands of refugees have been arriving in small inflatable boats, as upscale tourists do their best to unwind. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/04/world/europe/20150805-LESBOS-slide-SAMA/20150805-LESBOS-slide-SAMA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/04/world/europe/20150805-LESBOS-slide-SAMA/20150805-LESBOS-slide-SAMA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/04/world/europe/20150805-LESBOS-slide-SAMA/20150805-LESBOS-slide-SAMA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/04/world/europe/20150805-LESBOS-slide-SAMA/20150805-LESBOS-slide-SAMA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/04/world/europe/20150805-LESBOS-slide-SAMA/20150805-LESBOS-slide-SAMA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thu