alapeño muffins.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You may have eaten corn on the cob for the Fourth of July, but now is the time to get your fill. Joining the ranks at the corn stand and rummaging for the best ears (heavy and green, with fresh-looking husks and silk) is a summer ritual. The reward for waiting is blissfully sweet corn, the kind that induces a certain euphoria.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Beyond Corn on the Cob', 'kicker': 'City Kitchen', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corn', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Summer (Season)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-04T21:11:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Tanis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tanis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dd125e81-7d1a-598e-bcca-8870232855f7', 'word_count': 229, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dd125e81-7d1a-598e-bcca-8870232855f7'}, {'abstract': 'This concert at Alice Tully Hall, part of Mostly Mozart, yielded a sudden burst of illumination during Beethoven’s String Quartet in F.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/05/arts/music/review-emerson-string-quartet-plays-beethoven-mozart-and-faure.html', 'snippet': 'This concert at Alice Tully Hall, part of Mostly Mozart, yielded a sudden burst of illumination during Beethoven’s String Quartet in F.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sometimes there is a moment in a concert when the music-making suddenly comes into focus. During the Emerson String Quartet’s recital at Alice Tully Hall on Monday 