hives: The unemployment rate in the United States drops to an eight-year low in 1965.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The unemployment rate dropped to an eight-year low in July and President Johnson pledged today that his administration would try to cut it further. The Labor Department announced that unemployment fell to 4.5 percent of the working force last month from 4.7 percent in June. It attributed the drop to the heavy hiring of teenagers, young men, and adult women. Employment jumped sharply to a record high of 74,854,000. There were 1.1 million more at work in July than in June and 2.4 million more than in July a year ago. Mr. Johnson said he was ‘‘extremely pleased.’’ — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, August 6, 1965', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1965: U.S. Jobless Rate at New Low', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Lyndon Baines', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Labor Department (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-05T16:08:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8abe86cb-03f7-53e6-a1a3-4479377e58cf', 'word_count': 110, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8abe86cb-03f7-53e6-a1a3-4479377e58cf'}, {'abstract': 'The actor and writer is appearing Off Broadway in his solo show “The Absolute Brightness of Leonard Pelkey.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/09/theater/james-lecesne-of-the-trevor-project-inhabiting-lives-and-saving-them.html', 'snippet': 'The actor and writer is appearing Off Broadway in his solo show “The Absolute Brightness of Leonard Pelkey.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Late in the first episode of Caitlyn Jenner’s documentary series “I Am Cait,” Ms. Jenner visits the family of Kyler Prescott, a 14-year-old transgender boy who committed suicide in May. “It’s so hard for young people,” Ms. Jenner says. “They can’t see the future, and because of that they become extraordinarily desperate and suicide becomes an option. We have to do something about that.” ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09LECESNE2SUB/09LECESNE2SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09LECESNE2SUB/09LECESNE2SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09LECESNE2SUB/09LECESNE2SUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 664, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09LECESNE2SUB/09LECESNE2SUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1329, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09LECESNE2SUB/09LECESNE2SUB-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09LECESNE2SUB/09LECESNE2SU