 player in the global energy trade.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RAS LAFFAN, Qatar — The temperature hovered around 100 degrees on the jetty here, where a set of pipes were connected to a giant red-hulled ship. But the moisture in the air froze on the pipes and flaked off, creating snowlike flurries on the early summer evening.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Liquefied Natural Gas Makes Qatar an Energy Giant', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gas Makes Qatar a Giant in Energy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reed, Stanley', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Qatar', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Natural Gas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thani, Hamad bin Khalifa al-', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-05T16:56:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Energy & Environment ', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stanley Reed', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stanley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Reed', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/30f5c8d4-7b37-52b6-ac5d-728fc8ea52b2', 'word_count': 1664, 'uri': 'nyt://article/30f5c8d4-7b37-52b6-ac5d-728fc8ea52b2'}, {'abstract': 'In 2014, Qatar produced more than a third of all liquefied natural gas, which is chilled to minus 260 degrees.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2015/08/04/business/qatar-s-liquid-gold.html', 'snippet': 'In 2014, Qatar produced more than a third of all liquefied natural gas, which is chilled to minus 260 degrees.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 2014, Qatar produced more than a th