And Betsey Johnson is holding a yard sale in the Hamptons.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/06/fashion/shopping-events-and-sales-happening-this-week-in-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'At Moschino’s new boutique in SoHo, find an array of Looney Tunes items from Jeremy Scott. And Betsey Johnson is holding a yard sale in the Hamptons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What’s up, Doc? This week, Moschino opens a New York boutique in SoHo. There you’ll find all manner of Looney Tunes-themed items from the designer Jeremy Scott’s fall collection, like a Bugs Bunny sweater dress ($895), a Tweety Bird bucket bag ($950) and a Daffy Duck iPhone 6 case ($75) to celebrate your inner child. At 73 Wooster Street.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/06/fashion/06SCOUTING/06SCOUTING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 297, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/06/fashion/06SCOUTING/06SCOUTING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 297}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/06/fashion/06SCOUTING/06SCOUTING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 507, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/06/fashion/06SCOUTING/06SCOUTING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1014, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/06/fashion/06SCOUTING/06SCOUTING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/06/fashion/06SCOUTING/06SCOUTING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thum