, and the visiting Mets held on after taking an 8-0 lead into the bottom of the ninth inning.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/06/sports/baseball/matt-harvey-and-mets-make-it-look-easy-until-marlins-erupt-in-final-inning.html', 'snippet': 'Matt Harvey pitched seven innings of two-hit ball, and the visiting Mets held on after taking an 8-0 lead into the bottom of the ninth inning.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — The Mets entered the bottom of the ninth inning Wednesday with an 8-0 lead. Matt Harvey had just put in a sterling performance: six strikeouts, two hits and no runs in seven efficient innings. Their offense, powered by recent additions, had hammered the Marlins’ pitching for 12 hits. The Mets were an inning away from a day off, nine strikes from their second straight series sweep.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/06/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/06/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/06/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/06/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/06/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy'