tic poses and get at the spirit and personalities of competitive bodybuilders.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/06/photographs-most-muscular/', 'snippet': 'Brian Finke wanted to go beyond the glistening muscles and dramatic poses and get at the spirit and personalities of competitive bodybuilders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Brian Finke’s photographs of the bodybuilding world, almost everyone and everything is ripped — even the trophies. Many of the men and women boast layers upon layers of muscles stacked like bricks, their thighs rippling with cuts and their bodies glowing from orange dye. Muscles are abundant, clothing is not: glittery bathing suits, thong-like “performance suits” and the occasional pair of heels.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photographs Most Muscular', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Body Building', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muscles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Finke, Brian', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Instagram Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Men's Journal", 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chelsea (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Las Vegas (Nev)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-06T07:00:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'origin