'', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b8f9e271-0b04-514f-9e58-1442e51819a1', 'word_count': 257, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b8f9e271-0b04-514f-9e58-1442e51819a1'}, {'abstract': 'Should Mondelez be put back together again with Kraft? Or should spinoff VMware absorb its parent EMC? It’s fantasy season for all the Street’s men.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/07/business/dealbook/humpty-dumpty-dealmaking.html', 'snippet': 'Should Mondelez be put back together again with Kraft? Or should spinoff VMware absorb its parent EMC? It’s fantasy season for all the Street’s men.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some of the finest minds in finance seem to have missed the lesson of the nursery rhyme “Humpty Dumpty”: All the king’s horses and all the king’s men couldn’t put that character together again.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Humpty Dumpty Deal-Making', 'kicker': 'Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'EMC Corporation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mondelez International', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kraft Foods Group Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'HJ Heinz Company', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'VMware Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ackman, William A', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-06T19:18:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rob Cox', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cox', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b35e0cbe-505e-5003-a820-2edc4f68046b', 'word_count': 376, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b35e0cbe-505e-5003-a820-2edc4f68046b'}, {'abstract': 'The helicopter, carrying a medical team and supplies, had taken off from Rawalpindi and was headed to a flood-hit northern region.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/07/world/asia/pakistan-army-helicopter-crash-gilgit.html', 'snippet': 'The helicopter, carrying a medical team and supplies, had taken off from Rawalpindi and was headed to a flood-hit northern region.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PAKISTAN — At least 12 people aboard a Pakistani Army helicopter were killed Thursday in northwestern Pakistan, a military spokesman said. They included a team of army doctors, paramedics, two pilots and crew. Officials said they were trying to determine the cause of the crash and suspected weather conditions to be responsible. The helicopter, carrying medical supplies, took off from Rawalpindi and was headed toward Gilgit, which has been affected recently by floods.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pakistan Army Helicopter Crashes, Killing 12', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aviation Accidents, Safety and Disasters', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rawalpindi (Pakistan)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-06T19:28:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Salman Masood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Salman', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Masood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organiz