er looks, will be dropped after the fall 2015 season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/06/fashion/brooks-brothers-discontinuing-black-fleece-collection.html', 'snippet': 'The line, which is designed by Thom Browne and is less traditional than the company’s other looks, will be dropped after the fall 2015 season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Devotees of Black Fleece, Thom Browne’s collection for Brooks Brothers, should hurry to stores to stock up. Claudio Del Vecchio, the Brooks Brothers chief executive, confirmed in a phone interview on Thursday that the Black Fleece line will be discontinued following the fall 2015 season, though he did not rule out the option of reviving it, potentially without Mr. Browne, in the future.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/06/fashion/06brooksbrothers1/06brooksbrothers1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/06/fashion/06brooksbrothers1/06brooksbrothers1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/06/fashion/06brooksbrothers1/06brooksbrothers1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 670, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/06/fashion/06brooksbrothers1/06brooksbrothers1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1341, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/06/fashion/06brooksbrothers1/06brooksbrothers1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015