'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By SOFIA PERPETUA and ROBIN LINDSAY', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sofia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'PERPETUA', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Robin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'LINDSAY', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/90a28654-3701-56e9-bed0-0d92c20a4bb3', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/90a28654-3701-56e9-bed0-0d92c20a4bb3'}, {'abstract': 'This South African artist shows his signature participatory artwork in two shows, one at the Drawing Center, in SoHo, and one at Lehmann Maupin, in Chelsea.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/07/arts/design/review-drawing-waves-and-borne-frieze-a-robin-rhode-twofer.html', 'snippet': 'This South African artist shows his signature participatory artwork in two shows, one at the Drawing Center, in SoHo, and one at Lehmann Maupin, in Chelsea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the South African artist Robin Rhode, drawing is never enough. He draws on gallery walls, then throws his body against the images he’s made, or drags his hands through the fresh chalk or charcoal. He draws in public places, in choreographed acts or in improvised, highly physical exertions. Drawing is not a stand-alone artistic medium; it forms part of a constellation of techniques, from performance to photography and video, which in turn informs a larger cluster of concerns, from his own childhood to the politics of urban space.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/arts/07RHODE/07RHODE-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/07/arts/07RHODE/07RHODE-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/arts/07RHODE/07RHODE-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/arts/07RHODE/07RHODE-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/arts/07RHODE/07RHODE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/07/arts/07RHODE/07RHODE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/arts/07RHODE/07RHODE-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Drawing Waves’ and ‘Borne Frieze,’ a Robin Rhode Twofer', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Full Body at Work in Those Drawings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Farago, Jason', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Drawing Center (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lehmann Maupin Gallery', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rhode, Robin', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-06T22:14:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jason Fara