runway shows and parties late into the night, while storing his belongings in a Y.M.C.A. locker and sleeping on a roof.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/07/movies/review-homme-less-follows-a-homeless-middle-age-model-photographer.html', 'snippet': 'A documentary shows a former model who hits the runway shows and parties late into the night, while storing his belongings in a Y.M.C.A. locker and sleeping on a roof.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Poignancy and pathos distinguish Thomas Wirthensohn’s polished documentary, “Homme Less,” a portrait of Mark Reay, a former model struggling as a photographer. The New Jersey-born Mr. Reay had a moment more than 20 years ago, posing for shoots in Europe. Now in his 50s, he entreats Marc Jacobs for work by leaving a photo of the designer at his office; talks women into posing for him on the street; and works as a day player on movie sets. But the title derives from Mr. Reay’s nightly shelter: an East Village rooftop, where he sleeps under a tarpaulin.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/arts/07HOMME/07HOMME-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/07/arts/07HOMME/07HOMME-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/arts/07HOMME/07HOMME-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 540, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/arts/07HOMME/07HOMME-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 540, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 