olks” from voting are threatening to erode the fundamental promise of the civil rights-era bulwark.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Urges Restoring Voting Rights Provisions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama Urges Restoring Voting Rights Provisions', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, Julie Hirschfeld', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting Rights Act (1965)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voter Registration and Requirements', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lewis, John R', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-07T01:01:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Hirschfeld Davis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': 'Hirschfeld', 'lastname': 'Davis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5e67841f-171f-5ea2-b9a0-87b573ec5a7c', 'word_count': 794, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5e67841f-171f-5ea2-b9a0-87b573ec5a7c'}, {'abstract': 'Chris Antley, who died in 2000 and is being inducted into the National Museum of Racing’s Hall of Fame on Friday, was known for his success on the track and his struggles off it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/07/sports/chris-antley-a-troubled-jockey-has-full-legacy-on-display.html', 'snippet': 'Chris Antley, who died in 2000 and is being inducted into the National Museum of Racing’s Hall of Fame on Friday, was known for his success on the track and his struggles off it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Natalie Jowett Antley does not know what she will say about her late husband, Chris Antley, when she speaks at the National Museum of Racing’s Hall of Fame on Friday. She has been worried more about how her daughter will hold up when the father who died before she was born will be recognized as one of the greatest jockeys of all time.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/sports/Y-ANTLEY-1/Y-ANTLEY-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 425, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/07/sports/Y-ANTLEY-1/Y-ANTLEY-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 425}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/sports/Y-ANTLEY-1/Y-ANTLEY-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 726, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/sports/Y-ANTLEY-1/Y-ANTLEY-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1452, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/sports/Y-ANTLEY-1/Y-ANTLEY-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/07/sports/Y-ANTLEY-1/Y-ANTLEY-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/sports/Y-ANTLEY-1/Y-ANTLEY-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Troubled Jockey’s Full Legacy Is on Display', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Troubled Star&#8217;s Full Legacy Is on Di