bs that he would like to teach his newborn son.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/07/fashion/mens-style/what-steve-jobs-taught-me-about-being-a-son-and-a-father.html', 'snippet': 'While mourning his mother, a new father thinks of a lesson he learned from Steve Jobs that he would like to teach his newborn son.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A couple of months ago, right after my first son was born, I thought about the lessons I wanted to pass along to him that I had learned a little late in life. Among the morals I scribbled down in my mind one that stood out began with a story involving Steve Jobs and ended with the serving of my mother’s last meal.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/fashion/07RITESOFPASSAGE/07RITESOFPASSAGE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 835, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/07/fashion/07RITESOFPASSAGE/07RITESOFPASSAGE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 835}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/fashion/07RITESOFPASSAGE/07RITESOFPASSAGE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 736, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/fashion/07RITESOFPASSAGE/07RITESOFPASSAGE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1472, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/fashion/07RITESOFPASSAGE/07RITESOFPASSAGE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/07/fashion/07RITESOFPASSAGE/07RITESOFPASSAG