ade about women,', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/08/07/donald-trump-criticizes-megyn-kelly-of-fox-news-again/', 'snippet': 'The businessman was angry over the anchors’ debate questions about his fitness to be president in the wake of disparaging remarks he has made about women,', 'lead_paragraph': 'Donald J. Trump kept his vow to remain unbeholden to political correctness after Thursday night’s debate, continuing to criticize the Fox News anchor Megyn Kelly for asking him questions that were too tough while he was on stage.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/08/us/080715firstdraft-MEGYN/080715firstdraft-MEGYN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/08/us/080715firstdraft-MEGYN/080715firstdraft-MEGYN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/08/us/080715firstdraft-MEGYN/080715firstdraft-MEGYN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/08/us/080715firstdraft-MEGYN/080715firstdraft-MEGYN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/08/us/080715firstdraft-MEGYN/080715firstdraft-MEGYN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/08/us/080715firstdraft-MEGYN/080715firstdraft-MEGYN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thum