 Russia — The gun went off for the medley relay final at the swimming world championships, and it quickly seemed that Russia was in deep trouble. Its backstroker rapidly fell behind the other seven swimmers and, by the end of the leg, was more than seven seconds behind the leader and nearly six seconds behind the next slowest swimmer.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/08/sports/08RELAYweb1/08RELAYweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/08/sports/08RELAYweb1/08RELAYweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/08/sports/08RELAYweb1/08RELAYweb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 641, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/08/sports/08RELAYweb1/08RELAYweb1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1281, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/08/sports/08RELAYweb1/08RELAYweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/08/sports/08RELAYweb1/08RELAYweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/08/sports/08RELAYweb1/08RELAYweb1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Men and Women Team Up and Face Off in Ne