jor': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trans-Pacific Partnership', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': "Martha's Vineyard (Mass)", 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-07T15:31:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a5928de8-c5e4-5a80-b47a-06ba3cff87e0', 'word_count': 892, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a5928de8-c5e4-5a80-b47a-06ba3cff87e0'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: An American Airlines stewardess was hit by a passenger in 1940.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/07/1940-stewardess-says-man-hit-her/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: An American Airlines stewardess was hit by a passenger in 1940.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A mysterious attack on a pretty twenty-two-year-old stewardess on a New York to Dallas, Tex., sleeper plane was being investigated yesterday by American Airlines officials. The girl swallowed a baggage compartment key after she was struck by an unidentified man thirty minutes before the plane landed at 11:40 p.m. Wednesday at Nashville, Tenn. The stewardess, Miss Rosemary Olive Griffith, who was taken to a hospital in Nashville after the plane landed, suffering from a bruised head and scratches on her legs and arms, told the story of the assault to C.R. Smith, president of the American Airlines, yesterday from her hospital bed. She was struck on the head just after entering the women’s lounge to get her bag, and fell to the floor unconscious after first swallowing the key which the intruder had demanded. — New York Herald Tribune, August 8, 1940', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1940: Stewardess Says Man Hit Her', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crime and Criminals', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN AIRLINES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-07T15:37:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bf1c6a96-588c-5455-a3a4-008fc613a103', 'word_count': 142, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bf1c6a96-588c-5455-a3a4-008fc613a103'}, {'abstract': 'The average price for a residence was reported to have hit $1.7 million, proof that the real estate market has bounced back from the 2008 recession.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2015/08/07/nyregion/manhattans-new-sales-record.html', 'snippet': 'The average price for a residence was reported to have hit $1.7 million, proof that the real estate market has bounced back from the 2008 recession.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The average price for a residence was reported to have hit $1.7 million, proof that the real estate market has bounced back from the 2008 recession.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/nyregion/manhattans-new-sales-record-1438901504938/manhattans-new-sales-record-1438901504938-articleLarge.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, '