ountry to be fatally attacked this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DHAKA, Bangladesh — A group of men on Friday slit the throat of Niladri Chaterjee, an activist whose social media posts were often critical of Islam, in the fourth fatal attack this year against secular bloggers, the police said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Another Secular Blogger in Bangladesh Is Killed', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'World Briefing | Asia; Bangladesh: Secular Blogger Is Killed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bangladesh', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manik, Julfikar Ali', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barry, Ellen (Per)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blogs and Blogging (Internet)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chaterjee, Niladri (d 2015)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-07T17:24:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julfikar Ali Manik and Ellen Barry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julfikar', 'middlename': 'Ali', 'lastname': 'Manik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Ellen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5acbc1e-dd23-568e-a746-afb1ae0d4c8e', 'word_count': 624, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5acbc1e-dd23-568e-a746-afb1ae0d4c8e'}, {'abstract': 'Mission Brief is passing up the Hambetonian Oaks to