“Diver Down” (1982); Mötley Crüe, “Shout at the Devil” (1983); Van Halen, “1984” (1984); Mötley Crüe, “Theatre of Pain” (1985); Van Halen, “5150” (1986); Mötley Crüe, “Girls, Girls, Girls” (1987); Van Halen, “OU812” (1988); Mötley Crüe, “Dr. Feelgood” (1989). It was a rich decade for headbanger decadence, toggling between Mötley Crüe’s devil-may-care Dionysian pop-metal and Van Halen’s howling blue-collar arena aerobics — competing approaches, both demanding copious amounts of hair spray. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09GUIDE3/09GUIDE3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09GUIDE3/09GUIDE3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09GUIDE3/09GUIDE3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09GUIDE3/09GUIDE3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09GUIDE3/09GUIDE3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09GUIDE3/09GUIDE3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09GUIDE3/09GUIDE3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'c