worker and Paige Spara as the object of his unspoken affection.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/09/arts/television/on-kevin-from-work-an-office-romance-built-for-one.html', 'snippet': 'The new ABC Family sitcom, which has its premiere on Wednesday night, features Noah Reid as a lovelorn worker and Paige Spara as the object of his unspoken affection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kevin (Noah Reid), an earnest young office worker, finally gets to quit the worst job in history. Every bit of it stinks, except for the colleague with whom he has shared a cubicle wall for three years: Audrey (Paige Spara), perpetually backlit, her hair tousled by a magical breeze and the wings of the animated bluebirds that suddenly appear every time she is near. And like them, Kevin longs to be close to her. If only she didn’t have a lunk of a boyfriend — which is why Kevin has banished himself and his shredded heart to Italy, but not before pouring his passion into a love letter and mailing it. After all, he’s never going to see her again.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09GUIDE2/09GUIDE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 411, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09GUIDE2/09GUIDE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 411}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09GUIDE2/09GUIDE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 702, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/arts/09GUIDE2/09GUIDE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1403, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail'