ty seat. The distressing warm patch of a vertical pole — which fellow traveler made it so, and what is his recent medical history? — tethering riders to their transit fate.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Photographer Puts Subway Riders’ Idle Hands to Work', 'kicker': 'Album', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Show of Hands', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Flegenheimer, Matt (Per)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subways', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transit Systems', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-07T22:42:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Flegenheimer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Flegenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b2e8f196-4318-5109-9dd3-64471b77cfcc', 'word_count': 293, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b2e8f196-4318-5109-9dd3-64471b77cfcc'}, {'abstract': 'Only the most attention-hungry candidates show up in the post-debate spin room, which explains why Donald Trump was there.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/07/magazine/falling-all-over-trump.html', 'snippet': 'Only the most attention-hungry candidates show up in the post-debate spin room, which explains why Donald Trump was there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There was a moment at the Republican debate in Cleveland on Thursday night — actually, there were several moments, but this one in particular lingered, and lingers, as an illuminating episode. You’ll never guess who was in the middle of it: starts with T and ends with “rump.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/magazine/07trump/07trump-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/07/magazine/07trump/07trump-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/magazine/07trump/07trump-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/magazine/07trump/07trump-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/magazine/07trump/07trump-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/07/magazine/07trump/07trump-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/07/magazine/07trump/07trump-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Falling All Over Trump', 'kicker': 'Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Debates (Political)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-07T22:43:24+0000', 'document_