n Attacked by ISIS', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christians and Christianity', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Missing Persons', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kidnapping and Hostages', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Qariyatain (Syria)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-08T01:19:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Hubbard and Hwaida Saad', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hubbard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Hwaida', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Saad', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5e6f9794-3844-5694-95da-5dac24454df8', 'word_count': 499, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5e6f9794-3844-5694-95da-5dac24454df8'}, {'abstract': 'The very structure of St. Louis County’s family court system seems designed to deny due process and representation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/08/opinion/children-caught-in-a-racist-system.html', 'snippet': 'The very structure of St. Louis County’s family court system seems designed to deny due process and representation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Justice Department cast the St. Louis County, Mo., law enforcement system in a harrowing light in March when it documented entrenched racism and unconstitutional policing in the town of Ferguson, which erupted in riots last year after a white police officer killed Mich