al-in-letter-to-obama.html', 'snippet': 'The letter from some of the world’s most knowledgeable experts in nuclear weapons and arms control called the agreement to limit Iran’s nuclear program innovative and stringent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Twenty-nine of the nation’s top scientists — including Nobel laureates, veteran makers of nuclear arms and former White House science advisers — wrote to President Obama on Saturday to praise the Iran deal, calling it innovative and stringent.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '29 U.S. Scientists Praise Iran Nuclear Deal in Letter to Obama', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Scientists Support Iran Deal in Letter to Obama', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schumer, Charles E', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARMS CONTROL AND LIMITATION AND DISARMAMENT', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garwin, Richard L', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hecker, Siegfried S', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dyson, Freeman J', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Drell, Sidney D', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holt, Rush D Jr', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Anderson, Philip Warren (1923- )', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cooper, Leon N', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Glashow, Sheldon Lee', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gross, David', 'rank': 15, 'maj