n Chester, C.T., is the result of its owners’ long-marinating idea to merge French and Vietnamese cuisine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/09/nyregion/hanoi-through-a-parisian-lens.html', 'snippet': 'Good Elephant in Chester, C.T., is the result of its owners’ long-marinating idea to merge French and Vietnamese cuisine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The vision for Everett and Linda Reid’s new restaurant began, like so many dreams, over a meal in Paris. But it was not a traditional French cafe that sparked the couple’s imagination, during that visit more than 20 years ago. Rather, it was the City of Light’s most famous Vietnamese eatery, Tan Dinh, still a fixture on the Seventh Arrondissement’s Rue de Verneuil. ', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/nyregion/09DINECT1/09DINECT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 329, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/09/nyregion/09DINECT1/09DINECT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 329}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/nyregion/09DINECT1/09DINECT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 561, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/nyregion/09DINECT1/09DINECT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1122, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/nyregion/09DINECT1/09DINECT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/09/nyregion/09DINECT1/09DINECT1-thumbStan