ore his death, Seau told his daughter Sydney that she should speak on his behalf if he made it into the Pro Football Hall of Fame. But the Hall, citing a five-year-old policy of not letting others give full speeches for deceased inductees, did not allow Sydney to deliver her speech.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Hall of Fame Speech Junior Seau’s Daughter Couldn’t Give', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Few Words About My Dad', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Seau, Sydney Beau', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pro Football Hall of Fame', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Seau, Junior', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Seau, Sydney Beau', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Speeches and Statements', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-09T01:34:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sydney Seau', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sydney', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Seau', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4f51f7c-322f-55c7-8b0f-024dfa74bf42', 'word_count': 1432, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4f51f7c-322f-55c7-8b0f-024dfa74bf42'}, {'abstract': 'Syndergaard, who in his previous nine starts was 4-1 with a 1.80 E.R.A., uncharacteristically stumbled as the Mets fell to the Rays at Tropicana Field.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/09/sports/baseball/noah-syndergaard-struggles-as-rays-end-mets-7-game-winning-streak.