 on television.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/10/sports/football/frank-gifford-early-nfl-celebrity-as-player-and-broadcaster-dies-at-84.html', 'snippet': 'Gifford was a Hall of Fame running back and receiver who personified the Giants’ glory years of the late 1950s and early ’60s and then became a mainstay on television.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Frank Gifford, a gleaming hero of sports and television in an era when such things were possible, who moved seamlessly from stardom in the Giants’ offense to celebrity in the broadcast booth of “Monday Night Football,” died on Sunday at his home in Greenwich, Conn. He was 84.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Frank Gifford, Star for Giants and in the Broadcast Booth, Dies at 84', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Frank Gifford, 84, Dies; His Celebrity Helped Push N.F.L. Into Spotlight', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Goldstein, Richard (Per)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weber, Bruce (Per)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC INC', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gifford, Frank', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-09T19:40:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Goldstein and Bruce Weber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firs