chine runs as a minor party candidate before, and how serious he is about it for the 2016 presidential race is about to be tested.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over nearly two decades, Donald J. Trump has given more than a little thought to a third-party presidential candidacy. How serious he is about it for 2016 is about to be tested. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s Not the First Time Donald Trump Has Flirted With a Third-Party Run', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2000', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stone, Roger J Jr', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Libertarian Party (US)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Reform Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-09T21:27:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Maggie Haberman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Maggie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Haberman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7462794d-4fff-5aac-bd44-88c9098be7ba', 'word_count': 756, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7462794d-4fff-5aac-bd44-88c9098be7ba'}, {'abstract': 'In this farce by Nicholas Korn, influenced by commedia dell’arte, a patriarch weighs the qualifications of three suitors courting his children; a fourth complicates matters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/10/theater/review-in-deliriums-daughters-dad-wrestles-daughters-suitors-one-dead.html', 'snippet': 'In this farce by Nicholas Korn, influenced by commedia dell’arte, a patriarch weighs the qualifications of three suitors courting his children; a fourth complicates matters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Things turn complex and lovely when the ghost appears in “Delirium’s Daughters.” It’s not a real ghost. Giovio isn’t dead; he has cleverly faked his own demise so that everyone will think kindly of him, especially his girlfriend’s father, who has rejected him as a prospective son-in-law. So he visits the man in the middle of the night.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/10/arts/10DELIRIUM/10DELIRIUM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 546, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/10/arts/10DELIRIUM/10DELIRIUM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 546}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/10/arts/10DELIRIUM/10DELIRIUM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 932, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/10/arts/10DELIRIUM/10DELIRIUM-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1864, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/10/arts/10DELIRIUM/10DELIRIUM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/10/arts/10DELIRIUM/10DELIRIUM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}