selection of letters, and a scattering of drawings, by that prolific and bellicosely opinionated author, from 1945 to 1993. According to the news release from Ecco, the book is “the first in a series of at least three Bukowski anthologies.” Batten down the hatches, folks — as surely everyone must know by now, this wasn’t a man inclined to edit himself.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/10/arts/10BOOKBUKOWSKI/10BOOKBUKOWSKI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 435, 'width': 370, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/10/arts/10BOOKBUKOWSKI/10BOOKBUKOWSKI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 435, 'width': 370, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/10/arts/10BOOKBUKOWSKI/10BOOKBUKOWSKI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/10/arts/10BOOKBUKOWSKI/10BOOKBUKOWSKI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/10/arts/10BOOKBUKOWSKI/10BOOKBUKOWSKI-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘On Writing,’ a Charles Bukowski Collection of Rants and Musings in Letters', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Unfiltered Artist, Raging on a Theme', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bukowski, Charles', 'rank'