.html', 'snippet': 'Even as Kurds are assisting in the campaign against the Islamic State in Syria, Turkey, a latecomer to the U.S.-led mission, is also bombarding Kurdish insurgent positions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HASAKA, Syria — Green drapes were drawn against the sun, cloaking the room where members of a Syrian Kurdish militia huddled around walkie-talkies, assiduously taking down GPS coordinates.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Inside Syria: Kurds Roll Back ISIS, but Alliances Are Strained', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Turkey&#8217;s Entry Into ISIS Battle May Upset Balance Among Allies ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kurds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Kurdistan Workers' Party", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kobani (Syria)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-10T07:30:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rukmini Callimachi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rukmini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Callimachi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/68f10dfa-ea0e-5ea1-b666-485a5509cbc9', 'word_count': 1919, 'uri': 'nyt://article/68f10dfa-ea0e-5ea1-b666-485a5509cbc9'}, {'abstract': 'Charges were filed against an 18-year-old who was shot by the police on the anniversary of the killing of Michael