an ever to hire a car or share a ride in many cities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/16/travel/airport-taxi-uber-lyft-bandwagon-tripda.html', 'snippet': 'With new services like Bandwagon and Tripda, and others expanding, there are more ways than ever to hire a car or share a ride in many cities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hailing a taxi nowadays can feel downright old-fashioned. New ride-sharing alternatives — such as Via, Bandwagon, Tripda and RideWith — are springing up in major cities and at airports. At the same time, established car services like Uber and Lyft are continuing to expand to more corners of the world while adding bells and whistles like Starbucks rewards points, free beach bags and on-demand water taxis.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/travel/16GETAWAY/16GETAWAY-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 459, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/16/travel/16GETAWAY/16GETAWAY-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 459}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/travel/16GETAWAY/16GETAWAY-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 784, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/travel/16GETAWAY/16GETAWAY-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1568, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/travel/16GETAWAY/16GETAWAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/16/travel/16GETAWAY/16GE