bStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/11/world/10nytnow-ferguson03/10nytnow-ferguson03-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/world/10nytnow-ferguson03/10nytnow-ferguson03-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Your Monday Briefing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-08-10T09:46:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NYTNow', 'section_name': 'NYT Now', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adeel Hassan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adeel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hassan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cf18e83a-1cb9-5606-a4b9-f0b265935bf3', 'word_count': 1078, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cf18e83a-1cb9-5606-a4b9-f0b265935bf3'}, {'abstract': 'My youngest child used to stand near other adults on line when the complaints began, as if he was with another, less-troublesome shopper.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/10/embarrassed-by-coupons-but-learning-how-to-save-to-splurge/', 'snippet': 'My youngest child used to stand near other adults on line when the complaints began, as if he was with another, less-troublesome shopper.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My middle child unwraps the red wax wrapping and bites into a chunk of cheese. “That cost 9 cents,” I tell him. Unimpressed, he eats another. “It was supposed to cost almost 50 cents,” I explain. “It comes in a pack of five, which normally costs $2.49. This week the package cost $1.99, less my 55-cent coupon, taking it down to 89 cents, and that’s before a 50-cent rebate. Divide that by five cheeses and you just ate 18 cents,” My son looks at me as he unwraps another cheese circle. “You’re scary,” he says at last. “But the cheese is pretty good for 9 cents.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/us/motherlode-coupons/motherlode-coupons-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/09/us/motherlode-coupons/motherlode-coupons-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/us/motherlode-coupons/motherlode-coupons-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/us/motherlode-coupons/motherlode-coupons-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/us/motherlode-coupons/motherlode-coupons-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/09/us/motherlode-coupons/motherlode-coupons-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/09/us/motherlode-coupons/motherlode-coupons-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Embarrassed by Coupons, but Learning How to Save to Splurge', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value