imate Change: Droughts Could Harm British Butterfly Species', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Butterflies and Moths', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nature Climate Change (Journal)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drought', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oliver, Tom H', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-10T17:34:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sindya N. Bhanoo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sindya', 'middlename': 'N.', 'lastname': 'Bhanoo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9c389a98-6878-560c-b9bc-e5e08f31ffc7', 'word_count': 203, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9c389a98-6878-560c-b9bc-e5e08f31ffc7'}, {'abstract': 'A plucky 11-year-old hits the road in Ivan Doig’s final novel.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/16/books/review/ivan-doig-last-bus-to-wisdom-review.html', 'snippet': 'A plucky 11-year-old hits the road in Ivan Doig’s final novel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By the time he died in April at age 75, Ivan Doig had created a body of work that helped shape our understanding of rural working-class life in the postwar American West. Raised by Montana ranchers in the 1940s and ’50s, Doig lived most of his adult years in Seattle but never really left Big Sky Country. From his early memoir, “This House of Sky,” to this final novel, “Last Bus to Wisdom,” Doig often gave Montana a leading role. Partly because of this emphasis, his work has been hit or miss for me. I’ve pounded the table in favor of some novels (once literally, as an award juror, for “Bucking the Sun”), and I’ve abandoned others halfway through, bored with the relentless Montanana.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/books/review/16BARCOTT/0816-BKS-Barcott-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 935, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/16/books/review/16BARCOTT/0816-BKS-Barcott-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 935}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/books/review/16BARCOTT/0816-BKS-Barcott-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 658, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/books/review/16BARCOTT/0816-BKS-Barcott-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1056, 'width': 678, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/books/review/16BARCOTT/0816-BKS-Barcott-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/16/books/review/16BARCOTT/0816-BKS-Barcott-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/books/review/16BARCOTT/0816-BKS-Barcott-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ivan Doig’s ‘Last Bus to Wisdom’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The West, Young Man', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barcott, Bruce', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, 