rump … but there are, yes, links between the two phenomena, which my old friend Reihan Salam teased out a bit for Slate last week:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Donald and Decadence', 'kicker': 'Ross Douthat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berlusconi, Silvio', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Le Pen, Marine', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salam, Reihan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mediterranean Sea', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South America', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-10T19:19:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Douthat', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Douthat', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/423f3730-bda3-531f-a760-f04441267a7e', 'word_count': 1073, 'uri': 'nyt://article/423f3730-bda3-531f-a760-f04441267a7e'}, {'abstract': 'Andrew Rossig and James Brady were fined $2,000 each and ordered to perform hundreds of hour