hemes from Disney to Bollywood, something hard looks soft, something inert looks alive — a cuff deep with pleats and creases, as delicate as a charm bracelet in motion. ', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '156', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/t-magazine/23tmag-08qual_thing_dior-t_CA0/23tmag-08qual_thing_dior-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/23/t-magazine/23tmag-08qual_thing_dior-t_CA0/23tmag-08qual_thing_dior-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/t-magazine/23tmag-08qual_thing_dior-t_CA0/23tmag-08qual_thing_dior-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/t-magazine/23tmag-08qual_thing_dior-t_CA0/23tmag-08qual_thing_dior-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1332, 'width': 1999, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/t-magazine/23tmag-08qual_thing_dior-t_CA0/23tmag-08qual_thing_dior-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/23/t-magazine/23tmag-08qual_thing_dior-t_CA0/23tmag-08qual_thing_dior-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/t-magazine/23tmag-08qual_thing_dior-t_CA0/23tmag-08qual_thing_dior-t_CA0-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 