190f5b4b72', 'word_count': 980, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e18c9a78-dc68-5830-b153-ff190f5b4b72'}, {'abstract': 'The country star’s fifth studio album is his most mature, and he’s no longer playing spring break raves. What a drag.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/11/arts/music/with-kill-the-lights-luke-bryan-downshifts-a-country-party.html', 'snippet': 'The country star’s fifth studio album is his most mature, and he’s no longer playing spring break raves. What a drag.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Luke Bryan turned 39 last month, and it’s safe to surmise that his hips are getting tired. For the last few years, he’s been playing a young man’s game — his brand of country music is dynamic, attitudinal, a little goofy. There are flickers of hip-hop in his phrasing; at his shows, he struts atop a tricked-out pickup truck. His most successful single is called “Country Girl (Shake It for Me).”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/arts/11BRYAN/11BRYAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/11/arts/11BRYAN/11BRYAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/arts/11BRYAN/11BRYAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 689, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/arts/11BRYAN/11BRYAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1379, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/arts/11BRYAN/11BRYAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 's