.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/11/arts/television/david-nobbs-novelist-and-creator-of-reginald-perrin-dies-at-80.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Nobbs, a British novelist and comedy writer, was best known for “The Fall and Rise of Reginald Perrin,” the dark BBC sitcom of the 1970s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Nobbs, a British novelist and comedy writer best known for “The Fall and Rise of Reginald Perrin,” the dark BBC sitcom of the 1970s that won an ardent following on both sides of the Atlantic, died on Saturday in Harrogate, England. He was 80.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/arts/11nobbs-1-obit-web/11nobbs-1-obit-web-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 430, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/11/arts/11nobbs-1-obit-web/11nobbs-1-obit-web-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 430}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/arts/11nobbs-1-obit-web/11nobbs-1-obit-web-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 734, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/arts/11nobbs-1-obit-web/11nobbs-1-obit-web-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1469, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/arts/11nobbs-1-obit-web/11nobbs-1-obit-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/11/arts/11nobbs-1-obit-web/11nobbs-1-obit-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0,