ile Cuddyer was out with a knee injury, the Mets acquired three veterans, and a top prospect earned their trust. So Cuddyer, even while earning $8.5 million this year, could become a bench player.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/11/sports/baseball/mets-michael-cuddyer-finds-job-is-no-longer-his-alone.html', 'snippet': 'While Cuddyer was out with a knee injury, the Mets acquired three veterans, and a top prospect earned their trust. So Cuddyer, even while earning $8.5 million this year, could become a bench player.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Michael Cuddyer arrived at work Monday as an active member of the Mets for the first time in about two and a half weeks, and found that his old position had been effectively filled. In that time, the Mets had acquired three veteran position players, the top prospect Michael Conforto had earned their trust, and they had propelled themselves into the playoff race.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/sports/Y-METS/Y-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/11/sports/Y-METS/Y-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/sports/Y-METS/Y-METS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/sports/Y-METS/Y-METS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1375, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/sports/Y-METS/Y-METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height':