5dc33ce', 'word_count': 86, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9b65c05c-ff47-5dfc-8171-221225dc33ce'}, {'abstract': 'The riots capped years of activism and anger, but the media pretended they were spontaneous. Sound familiar?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/11/opinion/50-years-later-we-still-havent-learned-from-watts.html', 'snippet': 'The riots capped years of activism and anger, but the media pretended they were spontaneous. Sound familiar?', 'lead_paragraph': 'ON AUG. 11, 1965, a California highway patrolman in the Watts section of Los Angeles pulled over an African-American man, Marquette Frye, for drunken driving. When another officer began hitting Mr. Frye and his mother, who had rushed to the scene, onlookers started throwing stones and bottles.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/opinion/11theoharis-web/11theoharis-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 461, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/11/opinion/11theoharis-web/11theoharis-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 461}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/opinion/11theoharis-web/11theoharis-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 787, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/opinion/11theoharis-web/11theoharis-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1575, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/11/opinion/11theoharis-web/11theoharis-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thum