 top winner is Kelly, who wrote about San Francisco-New York food wars, but we also crown 13 excellent Runners-Up and 12 Honorable Mentions. Scroll down to see if your name made our list.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/11/summer-reading-contest-winner-week-7-why-is-it-so-hard-to-get-a-great-bagel-in-california/', 'snippet': 'Our top winner is Kelly, who wrote about San Francisco-New York food wars, but we also crown 13 excellent Runners-Up and 12 Honorable Mentions. Scroll down to see if your name made our list.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every week, a rotating group of judges helps choose our Summer Reading Contest winner, runners-up and honorable mentions. A few of the judges, however, have now been on the panel all seven weeks, and they agree that this week’s crop of essays was, overall, the strongest yet. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Summer Reading Contest Winner, Week 7 | On ‘Why Is It So Hard to Get a Great Bagel in California?’', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-08-11T18:18:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0883d936-01bf-5bb3-adea-c85a245a3ed3', 'word_count': 524, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0883d936-01bf-5bb3-adea-c85a245a3ed3'}, {'abstract': 'Delegates from Amnesty International voted to support a policy that will allow the group to lobby governments to repeal most laws that forbid the sale and purchase of sex.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/12/world/europe/amnesty-international-votes-for-policy-calling-for-decriminalization-of-prostitution.html', 'snippet': 'Delegates from Amnesty International voted to support a policy that will allow the group to lobby governm