}, {'abstract': 'The closing of the Squibb Park Bridge last Aug. 11 was supposed to be temporary. Several deadlines for its reopening have come and gone, and now park officials refuse to give a new target date.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/12/nyregion/one-year-later-bouncy-bridge-in-brooklyn-remains-closed.html', 'snippet': 'The closing of the Squibb Park Bridge last Aug. 11 was supposed to be temporary. Several deadlines for its reopening have come and gone, and now park officials refuse to give a new target date.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After missing a number of reopening dates, the so-called bouncy bridge of Brooklyn Heights reached a dubious milestone on Tuesday: It has now been closed for repairs for exactly one year.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'One Year Later, ‘Bouncy Bridge’ in Brooklyn Remains Closed', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'One Year On, Bridge to Park Is Still Closed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Squibb Park Bridge (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bridges and Tunnels', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parks and Other Recreation Areas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Heights (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Bridge Park (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-11T23:57:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa W. Foderaro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Foderaro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/118e9a3c-598f-50c9-8df7-950ee07def98', 'word_count': 460, 'uri': 'nyt://article/118e9a3c-598f-50c9-8df7-950ee07def98'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Riggi was chief of the DeCavalcante family, New Jersey’s only indigenous mob group, but not, as some said, an inspiration for “The Sopranos.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/12/nyregion/john-riggi-former-head-of-decavalcante-crime-family-dies-at-90.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Riggi was chief of the DeCavalcante family, New Jersey’s only indigenous mob group, but not, as some said, an inspiration for “The Sopranos.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'John Riggi, a convicted New Jersey labor racketeer who was often mistakenly cited as an inspiration for the acclaimed HBO series “The Sopranos,” died on Aug. 3 at his home in Edison, N.J. He was 90.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/nyregion/12riggi-obit/12riggi-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 777, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/12/nyregion/12riggi-obit/12riggi-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 777}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/nyregion/12riggi-obit/12riggi-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 791, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/nyregion/12riggi-obit/12riggi-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1582, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/nyregion/12riggi-obit/12riggi-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/12/nyregion/