ncy, the price of oil plunged and stock markets fell, reflecting worry that the country’s leaders would be unable to bolster the economy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/12/business/dealbook/global-selling-shows-concerns-about-chinas-weakness.html', 'snippet': 'After China devalued its currency, the price of oil plunged and stock markets fell, reflecting worry that the country’s leaders would be unable to bolster the economy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After China shocked investors on Tuesday by devaluing the country’s currency, a wave of selling swept the globe. The price of oil plunged, the currencies of other countries tumbled and stock markets skidded on every continent.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/business/12GLOBALMARKETS/12GLOBALMARKETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 319, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/12/business/12GLOBALMARKETS/12GLOBALMARKETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 319}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/business/12GLOBALMARKETS/12GLOBALMARKETS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 544, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/business/12GLOBALMARKETS/12GLOBALMARKETS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1088, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/business/12GLOBALMARKETS/12GLOBALMARKETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/12/business/12GL