arily shut the plant, one of three buildings at its site in Zebulon, N.C., after the bacterium was found in a cooling tower.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/12/business/glaxo-closes-plant-after-legionnaires-bacterium-is-found.html', 'snippet': 'GlaxoSmithKline temporarily shut the plant, one of three buildings at its site in Zebulon, N.C., after the bacterium was found in a cooling tower.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GlaxoSmithKline temporarily shut down a major pharmaceutical manufacturing plant in North Carolina on Tuesday after the bacterium that causes Legionnaires’ disease was discovered in a cooling tower. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Glaxo Closes Plant After Legionnaires’ Bacterium Is Found ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Glaxo Closes Plant After Legionnaires&#8217; Bacterium Is Found ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'GlaxoSmithKline PLC', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Legionnaires' Disease", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shutdowns (Institutional)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bacteria', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-12T02:00:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/77fd2b28-da21-5d56-a33a-d1f8441f0381', 'word_count': 459, 'uri': 'nyt://article/77fd2b28-da21-5d56-a33a-d1f8441f0381'}, {'abstract': 'Tom McCoy offers us a meditative puzzle.', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/11/activity-on-lent-or-yom-kippur/', 'snippet': 'Tom McCoy offers us a meditative puzzle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WEDNESDAY PUZZLE — When there are starred clues in a puzzle, I immediately scan the list to see if there is a revealer that will help me guess the theme. It’s not always successful, but occasionally it pays off. Today was not one of those days, but that’s on me: I forgot that Tom McCoy tends to see things through a mathematical lens. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Looking Within', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-12T02:00:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/321c6f26-20bc-5387-af34-e229e44ce70a', 'word_count': 453, 'uri': 'nyt://article/321c6f26-20bc-5387-af34-e229e44ce70a'}, {'abstract': 'Taking part in a light, noncontact workout with U.S.A. Basketball, was a small but noteworthy step for Anthony, who has not played basketball since February, when he underwent surgery to repair a damaged tendon in his left knee.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/12/sports/basketball/carmelo-anthony-takes-step-in-test-of-knee.html', 'snippet': 'Taking part in a light, noncontact workout with U.S.A. Basketball, was a small but noteworthy step for Anthony, who has not played basketball since February, when he underwent surgery to repair a damaged tendon in his left knee.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Carmelo Ant