 Yankees’ squandered a hard-earned lead in the 10th inning when closer Andrew Miller, who had converted his first 24 save opportunities of the season, faltered.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/12/sports/baseball/yankees-loss-in-16th-shrinks-their-lead-to-half-a-game.html', 'snippet': 'The loss was especially crushing as the Yankees’ squandered a hard-earned lead in the 10th inning when closer Andrew Miller, who had converted his first 24 save opportunities of the season, faltered.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CLEVELAND — After last weekend, when simply pushing a runner across home plate seemed like such a monumental task for the Yankees, the sight of much-maligned Stephen Drew hitting a home run that ended a 31-inning scoreless streak inspired a sigh of relief Tuesday night. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/12/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1293, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/12/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Yankees’ Loss in 16th Shrinks Their Lead to Half a Game', 'kicker': 'Indians 5, Yankees 4 (16 Innings)', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yankees&#8217; Loss in 16th Shrinks Their Lead to Half a Game ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Witz, Billy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cleveland Indians', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brantley, Michael (1987- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Miller, Andrew (1985- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Severino, Luis (1994- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-12T04:39:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Billy Witz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Billy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Witz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6371a0b3-6335-505e-881b-dc85fe832dcf', 'word_count': 1074, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6371a0b3-6335-505e-881b-dc85fe832dcf'}, {'abstract': 'Television highlights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/12/arts/television/whats-on-tv-wednesday.html', 'snippet': 'Television highlights.', 'lead_paragraph': '8 P.M. (ABC Family) KEVIN FROM WORK Kevin (Noah Reid), an earnest young office worker, finally gets to quit the worst job in history. Every bit of it stinks, except for the colleague with whom he has shared a cubicle wall for three years: Audrey (Paige Spara), perpetually backlit, her hair tousled by a magical breeze and the wings of the animated bluebirds that suddenly appear every time she is near. And like them, Kevin longs to be close to her. If only she didn’t have a lunk of a boyfriend — which is why Kevin has banished himself and his shredded heart to Italy, but not before pouring his passion into a love letter and mailing it. After all, he’s never going to see her again, right? With a whisper of “(500) Days of Summer” in its DNA — those bluebirds again, and a younger sister (Jordan Hinson) to inflict pain — “Kevin From Work” heralds the return of the single-camera comedy to ABC Family. It also packs a secret weapon in Amy Sedaris, as Kevin’s monster of a boss.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Wednesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What&#8217;s On TV Wednesday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-12T05:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc82f7af-c5c6-53d0-823f-e142439da3fa', 'word_count': 710, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc82f7af-c5c6-53d0-823f-e142439da3fa'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on Wednesday, August 12, 2015.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/12/pa