, the festival to this day is directed by his descendants and solely devoted to his work.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/16/arts/music/bayreuth-festival-the-house-that-wagner-built-stays-on-course-but-changes.html', 'snippet': 'Founded by Richard Wagner and begun in 1876, the festival to this day is directed by his descendants and solely devoted to his work.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAYREUTH, Germany — Audience members headed to the Bayreuth Festival weren’t happy. The train route from Nuremberg, the principal way to reach this small town in northern Bavaria, was suspended because of construction. They would have to take a bus instead. It would be slow. It would be uncomfortable.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/arts/16BAYREUTH1/16BAYREUTH1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/16/arts/16BAYREUTH1/16BAYREUTH1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/arts/16BAYREUTH1/16BAYREUTH1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/arts/16BAYREUTH1/16BAYREUTH1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1356, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/arts/16BAYREUTH1/16BAYREUTH1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/16/arts/16BAYREUTH1/16BAYREUTH1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth