ntrol to another militant identified as Mahamoud Daoud. Mr. Déby did not elaborate on the source of this information, which could not be confirmed independently. But he asserted that Boko Haram’s capabilities had been crushed by the four-country military campaign against the group and that it would be finished as a fighting force by year’s end. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nigeria: Boko Haram Is Said to Have a New Leader', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Africa; Nigeria: Boko Haram Is Said to Have a New Leader', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nigeria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boko Haram', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chad', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shekau, Abubakar', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Deby, Idriss', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Niger', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cameroon', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-13T01:18:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/f14fd5e5-d212-53f8-ae31-6674d00ce927', 'word_count': 120, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f14fd5e5-d212-53f8-ae31-6674d00ce927'}, {'abstract': 'Karlovic has the most devastating serve in tennis, a point that was demonstrated Tue