b9-5860-8c48-abf2edd64871'}, {'abstract': 'Juan Lagares is playing with an injured right elbow, and he is essentially set to be replaced in center field by Yoenis Cespedes for the last two months of the season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/13/sports/baseball/a-new-role-for-juan-lagares-as-the-mets-keep-rolling.html', 'snippet': 'Juan Lagares is playing with an injured right elbow, and he is essentially set to be replaced in center field by Yoenis Cespedes for the last two months of the season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The other day in the Mets’ clubhouse, Juan Lagares and Ruben Tejada were joking and chatting with Yoenis Cespedes. They listened to him with reverence, the way some of the team’s young pitchers gather and listen to Bartolo Colon’s stories, the way a son might listen to his father. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/13/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/13/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/13/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/13/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1261, 'width': 1996, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/13/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard