hen running or hiking with their pets. Their rise in body temperature can be sudden and dangerously severe.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/13/the-dog-days-can-be-deadly-for-dogs/', 'snippet': 'Owners need to be particularly attentive to potential signs of heatstroke when running or hiking with their pets. Their rise in body temperature can be sudden and dangerously severe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When my friend’s husband recently headed out for a five-mile run with his 2-year-old Border terrier, Angus, with plenty of water and a collapsible bowl in tow, he never expected he’d end up at an animal hospital. The suburban New York trail they had been running on offered plenty of shade, and he stopped frequently for water breaks before heading home in his air-conditioned vehicle.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Dog Days Can Be Deadly for Dogs', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dogs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heatstroke', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-13T09:45:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Caitlin Kelly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Caitlin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kelly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc904e08-8357-54f3-98f3-bc473b982e1b', 'word_count': 840, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc904e08-8357-54f3-98f3-bc473b982e1b'}, {'abstract': 'Make that “6 Things I Need To Send Kids Back to School” that I don’t have, and can’t possibly buy.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/13/six-things-parents-need-for-back-to-school-that-we-cant-buy/', 'snippet': 'Make that “6 Things I Need To Send Kids Back to School” that I don’t have, and can’t possibly buy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s time to start getting ready. Time to start thinking about getting up earlier, planning car pools and shopping for school supplies. (Best way not to leave the store with a $100 worth of stuff that’s not on any list? Order online, or give your child just a tiny bit more than enough money and a list and wait in the car.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/us/motherlode-meteor2/motherlode-meteor2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/12/us/motherlode-meteor2/motherlode-meteor2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/us/motherlode-meteor2/motherlode-meteor2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/us/motherlode-meteor2/motherlode-meteor2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 960, 'width': 1280, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/us/motherlode-meteor2/motherlode-meteor2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/12/us/motherlode-meteor2/motherlode-meteor2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/12/us/motherlode-meteor2/motherlode-meteor2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy