 strong archetypes. I’d like to think that we can see through that.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '58', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/magazine/16talk/16talk-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/16/magazine/16talk/16talk-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/magazine/16talk/16talk-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/magazine/16talk/16mag-16talk-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/16/magazine/16talk/16mag-16talk-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1000}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/magazine/16talk/16mag-16talk-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 615, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/magazine/16talk/16mag-16talk-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1230, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tyra Banks Isn’t Running a Democracy Here', 'kicker': 'Talk', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tyra Banks Isn’t Running a Democracy Here', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cox, Ana Marie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value':