l-the-eye-in-matter-looks-at-an-artists-traces.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Seydel was more curator than artist, and his notebooks, collages and drawings show a variety of influences.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Robert Seydel is growing on me. This artist, who rarely exhibited during his lifetime, but worked as a curator and taught photography and film at Hampshire College in Amherst, Mass., died at 50 in 2011. He left behind an odd body of work — mostly notebooks, little collages and drawings — that are now on view in “Robert Seydel: The Eye in Matter” at the Queens Museum.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/14/arts/14SEYDEL/14SEYDEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 732, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/14/arts/14SEYDEL/14SEYDEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 732}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/14/arts/14SEYDEL/14SEYDEL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 840, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/14/arts/14SEYDEL/14SEYDEL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1680, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/14/arts/14SEYDEL/14SEYDEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/14/arts/14SEYDEL/14SEYDEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/14/arts/14SEYDEL/14SEYDEL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Robert Seydel: The Eye in Matter’ Looks at an Artist’s Traces', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'He Was Most Sincere in His Flattery', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Queens Museum', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Seydel, Robert (1960-2011)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-13T22:36:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martha Schwendener', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schwendener', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/25a3d237-3be6-5ef6-b206-8a874d1f011d', 'word_count': 848, 'uri': 'nyt://article/25a3d237-3be6-5ef6-b206-8a874d1f011d'}, {'abstract': 'Mrs. Clinton’s ambitious plan to reduce debt in higher education has put pressure on her campaign opponents to propose their own solutions to an intractable problem.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/14/us/with-350-billion-plan-hillary-clinton-prods-rivals-on-student-debt.html', 'snippet': 'Mrs. Clinton’s ambitious plan to reduce debt in higher education has put pressure on her campaign opponents to propose their own solutions to an intractable problem.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Hillary Rodham Clinton unveiled her plan this week to make higher education more affordable, Senator Marco Rubio of Florida promptly dismissed it as “Obamacare for college.” Jeb Bush, the former Florida governor, asserted that she would burden taxpayers by throwing more federal money at the problem.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/13/us/14COLLEGEWEB1/14COLLEGEWEB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/13/us/14COLLEGEWEB1/14COLLEGEWEB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/13/us/14COLLEGEWEB1/14COLLEGEWEB1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/13/us/14COLLEGEWEB1/14COLLEGEWEB1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1356, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/13/us/14COLLEGEWEB1/14COLLEGEWEB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/13/us/14COLLEGEWEB1/14COLLEGEWEB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/13/us/14COLLEGEWEB1/14COLLEGEWEB1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With $350 Billion Plan, Hillary Clinton Prods Rivals on Student Debt', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clinton Spurs Rivals With a Student Debt Plan ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bosman, Julie (Per)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'va