er', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nathaniel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Popper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f0024cc9-d133-551c-8090-ed6dc3313013', 'word_count': 443, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f0024cc9-d133-551c-8090-ed6dc3313013'}, {'abstract': 'The West Cornwall restaurant produces authentic, freshly prepared French bistro cuisine so good that diners don’t seem to mind that it has no website, takes no credit cards and has no menu.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/16/nyregion/restaurant-review-regulars-say-rsvp-does-everything-wrong-except-for-the-food.html', 'snippet': 'The West Cornwall restaurant produces authentic, freshly prepared French bistro cuisine so good that diners don’t seem to mind that it has no website, takes no credit cards and has no menu.', 'lead_paragraph': 'R.S.V.P., in West Cornwall, offers one of the most unusual dining experiences in the Northeast. So unusual, in fact, that some of the restaurant’s regular customers have accused it of doing everything wrong. Everything, that is, except for the food.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/nyregion/16DINECT2-3COMBO/16DINECT2-3COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/16/nyregion/16DINECT2-3COMBO/16DINECT2-3COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/nyregion/16DINECT2-3COMBO/16DINECT2-3COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': '