ial': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7fbe200-5430-595a-bd74-df36bf10eccd', 'word_count': 800, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7fbe200-5430-595a-bd74-df36bf10eccd'}, {'abstract': 'After making his mark backstage on shows like “My Fair Lady,” Mr. Liff became an agent whose clients included Julie Andrews, Angela Lansbury and Chita Rivera.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/14/theater/biff-liff-broadway-manager-and-powerhouse-agent-dies-at-96.html', 'snippet': 'After making his mark backstage on shows like “My Fair Lady,” Mr. Liff became an agent whose clients included Julie Andrews, Angela Lansbury and Chita Rivera.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When “My Fair Lady” opened on Broadway in 1956, there was Alan Jay Lerner’s book, and there was Biff Liff’s book. Mr. Liff’s book, the log he kept as the production stage manager, swelled to several volumes over the show’s long run, and the entries were not just about each performance.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/14/arts/14liff-obit/14liff-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 919, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/14/arts/14liff-obit/14liff-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 919}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/14/arts/14liff-obit/14liff-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 669, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/14/arts/14liff-obit/14liff-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1337, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/14/arts/1