mic group Ansarullah Bangla Team.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — Two men suspected of belonging to the extremist Islamic group Ansarullah Bangla Team have been arrested in Bangladesh in connection with the murder of a secular blogger this month, the police said on Friday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '2 Arrested in Killing of Secular Blogger in Bangladesh', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'World Briefing | Asia; Bangladesh: 2 Held in Blogger’s Killing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bangladesh', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Najar, Nida', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blogs and Blogging (Internet)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chaterjee, Niladri (d 2015)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ansarullah Bangla Team', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ansar al-Islam (Bangladesh)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-14T11:47:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nida Najar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nida', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Najar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/abd4d853-6cc6-5948-87ba-7d3b0c518f4d', 'word_count': 296, 'uri': 'nyt://article/abd4d853-6cc6-5948-87ba-7d3b0c518f4d'}, {'abstract': '“That Sugar Film” takes a look at what happens when you give up fresh foods for sugar-laden processed foods.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.