08/16/movies/how-jesse-eisenberg-makes-cup-of-noodles-a-weapon-in-american-ultra.html', 'snippet': 'The film’s director and stunt coordinator explain how they transformed Mr. Eisenberg’s character from a stoner into a lethal C.I.A. agent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Weed is not the only thing that is smoked in the violent action-comedy “American Ultra,” due Friday. Jesse Eisenberg plays Mike Howell, a stoner who works at a convenience store and who has, without his knowledge, been programmed by the C.I.A. to be a lethal sleeper agent. His dormant killer instincts are activated in the middle of a government operation, letting Mike transform whatever items he has at hand into weapons. An early scene, from which this frame is taken, shows Mike’s skills when, in a 10-second burst of action, he takes down two men sent to kill him by using a cup of noodles, a spoon and the gun they pull on him. It’s a quick but energetic scene that will probably shock the viewer as much as it does the character. Here is a closer look at that scene with commentary from the film’s director, Nima Nourizadeh, and its stunt coordinator, Robert Alonzo.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/arts/16AMERICAN-ULTRA/16AMERICAN-ULTRA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/16/arts/16AMERICAN-ULTRA/16AMERICAN-ULTRA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/arts/16AMERICAN-ULTRA/16AMERICAN-ULTRA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/arts/16AMERICAN-ULTRA/16AMERICAN-ULTRA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/arts/16AMERICAN-ULTRA/16AMERICAN-ULTRA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/16/arts/16AMERICAN-ULTRA/16AMERICAN-ULTRA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/arts/16AMERICAN-ULTRA/16AMERICAN-ULTRA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How Jesse Eisenberg Makes Cup of Noodles a Weapon in ‘American Ultra’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Stoner&#8217;s Weapon of Choice: Cup of Noodles', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murphy, Mekado', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nourizadeh, Nima', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eisenberg, Jesse', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stunts and Stuntmen', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'American Ultra (Movie)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-14T18:45:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/af272e8c-338d-5df7-b859-bf10a4e5308b', 'word_count': 767, 'uri': 'nyt://article/af272e8c-338d-5df7-b859-bf10a4e5308b'}, {'abstract': 'Eighteen presidential candidates from both parties have spoken or will speak at the Iowa State Fair, a chance for them to win over voters in an informal setting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/15/us/politics/candidates-crowd-iowa-fair-in-a-raucous-campaign.html', 'snippet': 'Eighteen presidential candidates from both parties have spoken or will speak at the Iowa State Fair, a chance for them to win over voters in an informal setting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DES MOINES — There are 75 foods on a stick, including apple pie and gluten-free corn dogs. There is a cow sculpted from butter. And there are 18 presidential candidates in a bipartisan stampede to the Iowa State Fair — bringing their stump speeches, of course, but more important, aiming to prove their common touch in the ultimate venue for retail campaigning.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/15/us/15IOWAweb1/15IOWAweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/15/us/15IOWAweb1/15IOWAweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/15/us/15IOWAweb1/15IOWAweb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/15/us/15IOWAweb1/15IOWAweb1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/15/us/15IOWAweb1/15IOWAweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 's