'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7ab5d1cd-cf90-5fa8-8bdc-d491e694e18b', 'word_count': 433, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ab5d1cd-cf90-5fa8-8bdc-d491e694e18b'}, {'abstract': 'Bustling with productivity, the Red Horse Market attracts celebrities like Martha Stewart, Alec Baldwin and the Kardashians, and its patrons are a devoted lot.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/16/nyregion/mozzarella-for-big-cheeses-at-an-east-hampton-market.html', 'snippet': 'Bustling with productivity, the Red Horse Market attracts celebrities like Martha Stewart, Alec Baldwin and the Kardashians, and its patrons are a devoted lot.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Unlike other East Hampton haunts treasured by affluent summer people for their beachy, low-key vibe, Red Horse Market bustles with productivity. The produce is arranged like a Flemish still life, women in equestrian garb demand to know the provenance of the grass in the grass-fed beef, and the Kardashian sisters once fought on camera in this small shop. Its patrons are a devoted lot. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mozzarella for Big Cheeses at an East Hampton Market', 'kicker': 'Neighborhood Joint', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mozzarella for Big Cheeses ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stowe, Stacey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Red Horse Market (East Hampton, NY, Retailer)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East Hampton (NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Supermarkets and Grocery Stores', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cheese', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Langella, Pasquale (1956- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-14T21:29:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'bylin