{'abstract': 'Jeff Chen’s childhood penchant for trouble gets him out of a tight constructing corner.', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/14/iconoclast-stiflers/', 'snippet': 'Jeff Chen’s childhood penchant for trouble gets him out of a tight constructing corner.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SATURDAY PUZZLE — Ironically, the very entry that Jeff Chen found hard to fill at 20 Down was one of the last entries that went in for me, and that was only because I am so used to using “click”-type ballpoint pens. I can’t remember the last time I used a pen with a cap, but that’s on me. I might have been more likely to be the back-of-the-head recipient of a flying PEN CAP in school, not that I’m bitter, Mr. Chen. But thanks for being “that guy.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Iconoclast Stiflers', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-15T02:00:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50d7eb98-24b3-5d84-80c6-e1b5b024fd0e', 'word_count': 403, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50d7eb98-24b3-5d84-80c6-e1b5b024fd0e'}, {'abstract': 'With 20 percent opting out this year, some statisticians say it is hard to determine whether students improved over all from last year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/15/nyregion/new-york-state-exam-refusals-make-analyzing-data-difficult.html', 'snippet': 'With 20 percent opting out this year, some statisticians say it is hard to determine whether students improved over all from last year.', 