n over the Blue Jays.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/15/sports/baseball/carlos-beltran-propels-yankees-past-blue-jays.html', 'snippet': 'Beltran’s pinch-hit three-run home run in the eighth inning gave the Yankees a win over the Blue Jays.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TORONTO — If, at age 38, Carlos Beltran is not the player he once was, he does not think of himself as anything other than an everyday player. He sticks to the same routine before each game, 25 or so batting practice cuts from each side of the plate, just enough to keep his swing finely tuned but not so many as to wear himself out.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/15/sports/SUB-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-CITY-YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/15/sports/SUB-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-CITY-YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 429}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/15/sports/SUB-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-CITY-YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 732, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/15/sports/SUB-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-CITY-YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1464, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/15/sports/SUB-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-CITY-YANKEES-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/15/sports/SUB-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-CITY-YANKEES-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumb