2015/08/16/opinion/sunday/sex-offenders-locked-up-on-a-hunch.html', 'snippet': 'Public safety would be better served if resources were directed toward community supervision and other services.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The essence of the American criminal justice system is reactive, not predictive: You are punished for the crime you committed. You can’t be punished simply because you might commit one someday. You certainly can’t be held indefinitely to prevent that possibility.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/opinion/sunday/16sun1/16sun1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/16/opinion/sunday/16sun1/16sun1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 745}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/opinion/sunday/16sun1/16sun1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 825, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/opinion/sunday/16sun1/16sun1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1713, 'width': 1379, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/opinion/sunday/16sun1/16sun1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/16/opinion/sunday/16sun1/16sun1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/opinion/sunday/16sun1/16sun1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 's