_count': 553, 'uri': 'nyt://article/69608909-05ea-5937-9a2d-36112438e863'}, {'abstract': 'Summer is what happens when you’re busy making other arrangements.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/16/opinion/sunday/mom-plans-god-laughs.html', 'snippet': 'Summer is what happens when you’re busy making other arrangements.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EVERY May, I start fantasizing about lazy, long days at the pool. I order a sundress from Athleta and picture myself wearing it while carrying a cheerful melamine platter of snacks and lemonade to my sweaty trio of children in the backyard. In June, I get a pedicure, bring the beach towels up from the basement, and compose a list of day trips we’ll embark on as soon as school gets out. This summer, my dream itinerary featured a spectrum of activities, ranging from rafting and boogie boarding to visiting a science museum and an aquarium. I imagined my family picking blueberries outside a tiny house in the Berkshires.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/opinion/sunday/16eegan/16eegan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/16/opinion/sunday/16eegan/16eegan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 690}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/opinion/sunday/16eegan/16eegan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 891, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/16/opinion/sunday/16eegan/16eegan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2012, 'width': 1750, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None,