'word_count': 946, 'uri': 'nyt://article/07387b66-53fa-51c9-8061-b06041862ad6'}, {'abstract': 'A very informal survey asking comedians for their favorite comics who never received their due yields a host of underrated names.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/17/arts/catch-charlie-barnett-and-other-rising-stand-up-stars-who-never-hit-the-top.html', 'snippet': 'A very informal survey asking comedians for their favorite comics who never received their due yields a host of underrated names.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I was walking through Central Park last year when I came across a comic on a bench selling jokes for a dollar. After I bought a punch line, we started talking comedy. “My dream,” he said, “is to be like Charlie Barnett.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/17/arts/17COMEDYJP1/17COMEDYJP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 904, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/17/arts/17COMEDYJP1/17COMEDYJP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 904}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/17/arts/17COMEDYJP1/17COMEDYJP1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 680, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/17/arts/17COMEDYJP1/17COMEDYJP1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1360, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/17/arts/17COMEDYJP1/17COMEDYJP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/17/arts/17COMEDYJP1/17