eld Municipal Airport broke into pieces, leaving no survivors, an official said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Four people were killed on Sunday when two small airplanes collided in flight near an airport in San Diego, according to the authorities.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Collision of 2 Small Planes Near a San Diego Airport Kills 4', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '4 Killed as Small Planes Collide Near a San Diego Airport ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aviation Accidents, Safety and Disasters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stack, Liam', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Diego (Calif)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-16T22:55:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liam Stack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eda64f13-200f-51b9-a99c-109871b70071', 'word_count': 286, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eda64f13-200f-51b9-a99c-109871b70071'}, {'abstract': 'After many disappointments, Day, a 27-year-old Australian, captured his first major title, finishing at 20 under par and holding off Jordan Spieth at Whistling Straits.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/17/sports/golf/jason-day-wins-pga-championship-for-first-major-title.html', 'snippet': 'After many disappointments, Day, a 27-year-old Australian, captured his first major title, finishing at 20 under par and holding off Jordan Spieth at Whistling Straits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HAVEN, Wis. — After a 314-yard drive on the par-5 16th hole at Whistling Straits, Jason Day had a decision to make. Ahead by three strokes in his bid to win his first major championship, Day could lay up with his next shot, which was the smart but conservative move, or go for the green as if he had nothing to lose.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/17/nyregion/17PGAWEB6/17PGAWEB6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/17/nyregion/17PGAWEB6/17PGAWEB6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/17/nyregion/17PGAWEB6/17PGAWEB6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/17/nyregion/17PGAWEB6/17PGAWEB6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/17/nyregion/17PGAWEB6/17PGAWEB6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/17/nyregion/17PGAWEB6/17PGAWEB6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/17/nyregion/17PGAWEB6/17PGAWEB6-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jason Day Wins P.G.A. Championship in a Record-Shattering Breakthrough', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Record-Shattering Breakthrough', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crouse, Karen (Per)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Day, Jason', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'PGA Championship', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-16T23:11:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d8cdb508-49de-52f0-a39f-2a7d347a384a', 'word_count': 1249, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8cdb508-49de-52f0-a39f-2a7d347a384a'}, {'abstract': 'Parnell, a Mets reliever, took the loss in two of the Mets’ three defeats by the Pirates.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/17/sports/baseball/parnell-and-mets-stumble-as-pirates-complete-sweep.html', 'snippet': 'Parnell, a Mets reliever, took the loss in two of the Mets’ three defeats by the Pirates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Mets and the Pittsburgh Pirates, one of the best teams in baseball, were tied, 1-1, at Citi Field on Sunday when Pirates pinch-hitter Michael Morse hit a comebacker to the mound in the seventh inning. The Pirates had a runner on first with no outs. It was a routine play, the kind winning teams execute with ease.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/17/sports/17METS/17METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/17/sports/17METS/17METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit