t-theteen-choice-awards.html', 'snippet': 'Britney Spears had tie-dye hair, Jussie Smollett sported a hat, Zendaya rocked a high waist skirt and more style choices from the show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 2015 Teen Choice Awards on Sunday evening brought together a bevy of stars, including Zendaya, Britney Spears and Shay Mitchell.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Looks from the Blue Carpet at the\xa0Teen Choice Awards', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-17T16:29:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0b137a92-f00a-5ea4-be30-3fbadc7ba8fa', 'word_count': 41, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0b137a92-f00a-5ea4-be30-3fbadc7ba8fa'}, {'abstract': 'He will appear on October 17.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/17/tracy-morgan-host-saturday-night-live/', 'snippet': 'He will appear on October 17.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than a year after he was critically injured in an automobile accident, Tracy Morgan will return to host “Saturday Night Live” in his first announced performance since the accident. NBC said on Monday that Mr. Morgan, an alumnus of “Saturday Night Live” and the comedy series “30 Rock,” is scheduled to host “S.N.L.” on Oct. 17 in one of its first new episodes of the fall season. He has been recovering since he was injured in a crash on the New Jersey Turnpike in June 2014, when a luxury van he was riding in was struck from behind by a Walmart tractor-trai