r Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Botticelli, Michael P (1958- )', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-17T19:07:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/90dd1305-3ad8-5016-873a-a58f6a6850fc', 'word_count': 643, 'uri': 'nyt://article/90dd1305-3ad8-5016-873a-a58f6a6850fc'}, {'abstract': 'With a week off from his nightly restaurant routine, the critic Pete Wells gets to call his own shots, finding his own kitchen rhythm along the way.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/19/dining/summer-vacation-goodbye-restaurants-hello-kitchen.html', 'snippet': 'With a week off from his nightly restaurant routine, the critic Pete Wells gets to call his own shots, finding his own kitchen rhythm along the way.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are people who plan their vacations around restaurant reservations that have to be secured months in advance. I am not one of them. When I need to get away from it all, competing for a table is one of the main things I’m getting away from. That, and meals longer than a filibuster, and hearing that “Chef” would like me to eat this particular taste in one bite while rubbing my stomach and patting my head.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/dining/19VACATION/19VACATION-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 592, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/19/dining/19VACATION/19VACATION-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 592}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/dining/19VACATION/19VACATION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1011, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/dining/19VACATION/19VACATION-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1513, 'width': 1533, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/dining/19VACATION/19VACATION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/19/dining/19VACATION/19VACATION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/dining/19VACATION/19VACATION-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Summer Vacation: Goodbye Restaurants, Hello Kitchen', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'So Long, Menus; Hello, Pots and Pans', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wells, Pete (Per)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Summer (Season)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New England States (US)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-17T19:07:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pete Wells', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pete', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wells', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/74b04408-df27-50c5-adc0-92e52ca36408', 'word_count': 1397, 'uri': 'nyt://article/74b04408-df27-50c5-adc0-92e52ca36408'}, {'abstract': 'The discovery of a hostile but symbiotic three-way relationship has led to the Large Blue butterfly’s comeback in Britain.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/18/science/the-butterfly-the-ant-and-the-oregano.html', 'snippet': 'The discovery of a hostile but symbiotic three-way relationship has led to the Large Blue butterfly’s comeback in Britain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It may be hard to imagine a ménage à trois, satisfactory to all parties, in which one member tries to dislodge another with a toxic gas and a third eats the offspring of the other two. But such an arrangement exists, and one of its members may even be sitting quietly in your kitchen’s spice rack.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/18/science/18Butterfly/18Butterfly-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 296, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/18/science/18Butterfly/18Butterfly-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 296}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/18/science/18Butterfly/18Butterfly-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 505, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/18/science/18Butterfly/18Butterfly-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 1210, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'super