,’ ‘Really Good’ and Done in a Day', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jury Duty for Trump: &#8216;Amazing,&#8217; &#8216;Really Good&#8217; and Over in One Day ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jury System', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-17T20:43:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr. and Andy Newman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr.', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Newman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac33da48-60bd-55d6-9046-0cb4da600f41', 'word_count': 908, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac33da48-60bd-55d6-9046-0cb4da600f41'}, {'abstract': 'At the P.G.A. Championship, Jason Day broke through with his first win in a major, but top golfers such as Sergio Garcia and Lee Westwood remain without a major title.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/18/sports/golf/jason-day-exits-the-talented-fraternity-that-has-no-major-win.html', 'snippet': 'At the P.G.A. Championship, Jason Day broke through with his first win in a major, but top golfers such as Sergio Garcia and Lee Westwood remain without a major title.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HAVEN, Wis. — Can we agree that it has never been harder to win a major in men’s professional golf? Consider the case of Justin Rose, who produced 72-hole scores of 14 under par at the Masters and the P.G.A. Championship only to lose by a combined 10 strokes. In golf’s four showcase events, Rose was 34 under, the fourth-lowest cumulative total in history.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/18/sports/18CROUSEweb1/18CROUSEweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/18/sports/18CROUSEweb1/18CROUSEweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/18/sports/18CROUSEweb1/18CROUSEweb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/18/sports/18CROUSEweb1/18CROUSEweb1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/18/sports/18CROUSEweb1/18CROUSEweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/18/sports/18CROUSEweb1/18CROUSEweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/18/sports/18CROUSEweb1/18CROUSEweb1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As Winning Majors Gets Tougher, Losing Them Is Easier to Stomach', 'kicker': 'On Golf', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tougher to Win, Easier to Take Letdown ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crouse, Karen (Per)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Day, Jason', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garcia, Sergio', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Dustin', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Westwood, Lee', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rose, Justin', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'PGA Championship', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-17T20:51:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b0e1cff-8cac-528e-a75a-25c1bdef9b41', 'word_count': 916, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b0e1cff-8cac-528e-a75a-25c1bdef9b41'}, {'abstract': 'As American naval ships roam the waters along Iran’s coastline, Iranian fighter jets patrol the skies watching them in what sometimes seems like a high-risk game.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/18/world/middleeast/us-and-iran-keep-wary-eye-on-each-other-at-sea.html', 'snippet': 'As American naval ships roam the waters along Iran’s coastline, Iranian fighter jets patrol the skies watching them in what sometimes seems like a high-risk game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MANAMA, Bahrain — The commander of the Navy’s Fifth Fleet was in his office on the afternoon of July 25 when he got the phone call: An Iranian Navy frigate in the Gulf of Aden had approached a ship where an American military helicopter had just landed.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times