 on, Americans.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/18/opinion/what-your-vacation-says-about-you.html', 'snippet': 'Introverts like the mountains, while extroverts like the beach. And Europeans? They just like vacation. Work on, Americans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TWENTY-THREE years ago, my wife and I were having an argument about how to celebrate our first anniversary. Money was tight, and we had to choose between taking a beach vacation or buying a couch, which we did not have. Being a Spaniard, she naturally advocated for the beach. As a thrifty American, I argued for the couch because it was permanent. In the end, we compromised — we went to the beach.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/13/opinion/arthur-brooks/arthur-brooks-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/02/13/opinion/arthur-brooks/arthur-brooks-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/13/opinion/arthur-brooks/arthur-brooks-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/13/opinion/arthur-brooks/arthur-brooks-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/02/13/opinion/arthur-brooks/arthur-brooks-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/13/opinion/arthur-brooks/arthur-brooks-jumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1