argoes and Sanctions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-18T12:51:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Harwood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harwood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/617651fd-9a38-5cb6-b6da-7cc574715dfe', 'word_count': 734, 'uri': 'nyt://article/617651fd-9a38-5cb6-b6da-7cc574715dfe'}, {'abstract': 'The tycoon’s fear-mongering about Mexican immigrants will ultimately rebound on him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/19/opinion/why-latino-children-are-scared-of-donald-trump.html', 'snippet': 'The tycoon’s fear-mongering about Mexican immigrants will ultimately rebound on him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LYNWOOD, Calif. — MANY monsters and ghosts haunt the dreams of Latino children. There is “La Llorona,” who is said to moan for her dead children. And more recently, the Chupacabra, which sucks the blood from farm animals and maybe a boy or a girl if he or she doesn’t behave.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/opinion/19tobar-web/19tobar-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', '