ytimes.com/2015/08/18/1890-finding-a-substitute-for-war/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: The Portuguese use spitting bowls to represent Englishmen in 1890.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Portuguese have discovered a substitute for war, which is both cheaper and more feasible than arbitration. Portugal has recently quarreled with England, but it was impolite for her to declare war against such a powerful adversary. The Portuguese therefore relieve their minds by the use of ‘‘spittoons,’’ made to represent pompous and plethoric Englishmen. Germany might demand the settlement of her next dispute with Russia under penalty of furnishing every German home with a receptacle for sauerkraut made in the image of a moujik. Thus would the horrors and expenses of war be avoided, while at the same time the overburdened hearts of nations relieved. — The New York Herald, European Edition, August 19, 1890', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1890: Finding a Substitute for War', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War and Revolution', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'England', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Portugal', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-18T13:41:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d24c0f24-1480-546f-b897-aa910079a606', 'word_count': 116, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d24c0f24-1480-546f-b897-aa910079a606'}, {'abstract': 'Performances by Wendy Whelan, Pacific Northwest Ballet, and the return of the Flamenco Festival are added to the City Center spring season.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/18/city-center-adds-to-season-with-wendy-whelan-ballet-and-flamenco/', 'snippet': 'Performances by Wendy Whelan, Pacific Northwest Ballet, and the return of the Flamenco Festival are added to the City Center spring season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wendy Whelan, the former New York City Ballet dancer whose retirement has been anything but quiet, will perform at City Center as part of three programs that have been added to round out the theater’s spring season.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'City Center Adds to Season With Wendy Whelan, Ballet and Flamenco', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ballet and Flamenco Are Added by City Center', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Flamenco (Dance)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Forsythe, William (1949- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Watson, Edward (1976- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wheeldon, Christopher', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Whelan, Wendy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York City Center Theater', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pacific Northwest Ballet', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-18T13:42:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joshua Barone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joshua', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/51ddf95f-f10