e/bbe83da6-f717-5684-a89d-d3aca971ad36'}, {'abstract': 'The government has insisted that it ensured the safety of the city’s air, but after rain on Tuesday, the streets began to foam.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/19/world/asia/china-identifies-executives-of-company-linked-to-tianjin-explosions.html', 'snippet': 'The government has insisted that it ensured the safety of the city’s air, but after rain on Tuesday, the streets began to foam.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — Within minutes of the immense chemical explosions that sent apocalyptic fireballs into the night sky over Tianjin, Zhou Haisen, 23, was making arrangements to leave town. He was terrified that poisonous gases would reach his apartment six miles from the scene, and his fears were swiftly reinforced by posts on Chinese social media. So he and his parents fled to his grandmother’s house an hour’s drive away.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/world/Foreign-referpromo/Foreign-refer-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 285, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/19/world/Foreign-referpromo/Foreign-refer-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 285}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/world/Foreign-referpromo/Foreign-refer-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 486, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/world/Foreign-referpromo/Foreign-refer-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 971, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/