eminder of Generation 3, the one first marketed as a four-door sports car. The new model is now a bit longer and lower.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NISSAN has offered few reasons for buyers to step up from a loaded Altima to the Maxima the last few years. Many of the same features and much of the same performance and design panache in the Maxima could be had with its less expensive sibling. There was no 2015 Maxima, and what 2014 models remained were sold to loyalists (and there are many) — until the 2016 models arrived this summer.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video Review: New Maxima Gives Nissan Fans a Reason to Trade Up', 'kicker': 'Driven', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Maxima Gives Nissan Fans a Reason to Trade Up', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nissan Motor Co', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-18T19:09:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'subsection_name': 'New Cars', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Voelk', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Voelk', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/46b7acd2-9a2e-521f-9d0b-df755a23c4ba', 'word_count': 551, 'uri': 'nyt://article/46b7acd2-9a2e-521f-9d0b-df755a23c4ba'}, {'abstract': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission accused the bank of doling out three internships to appease officials at a Middle Eastern sovereign wealth fund.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/19/business/dealbook/bank-of-new-york-mellon-settles-bribery-case-over-interns.html', 'snippet': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission accused the bank of doling out three internships to appease officials a