k to be the Democratic nominee\xa0— let me use this post to quickly hedge a more recent bet: Namely, that the rise of Donald Trump might be a much-needed gift to Jeb Bush’s struggling “frontrunner” campaign. I offered various arguments three weeks ago for why this might be so, and most\xa0of them might yet be\xa0vindicated once we leave the preliminary phase of the campaign, Jeb starts spending ad dollars in earnest, the establishment field gets winnowed and\xa0voters get serious about the nominating process. But here’s one passage from my column that I want to revisit, because I’m not sure the first debate was kind to it:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump and the Charisma Premium', 'kicker': 'Ross Douthat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-08-19T14:36:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Douthat', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Douthat', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5601f0f1-eccb-584e-85e6-0ddc3eea989d', 'word_count': 768, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5601f0f1-eccb-584e-85e6-0ddc3eea989d'}, {'abstract': 'Thailand’s national police chief said on Wednesday that there is likely more than one person involved in the fatal explosion at a Bangkok shrine on Monday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/asia/100000003861358/police-more-suspects-in-bangkok-bombing.html', 'snippet': 'Thailand’s national police chief said on Wednesday that there is likely more than one person involved in the fatal explosion at a Bangkok shrine on Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thailand’s national police chief said on Wednesday that there is likely more than one person involved in the fatal explosion at a Bangkok shri