abstract': 'More ideas plutocrats love but voters hate.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/19/pension-cutters-and-privatizers-oh-my/', 'snippet': 'More ideas plutocrats love but voters hate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I wrote Monday about the strange phenomenon of Republicans lining up to propose cuts to Social Security, a deeply unpopular policy that is, however, also a really bad idea. How unpopular? Lee Drutman has the data: only 6 percent of American voters support Social Security cuts, while a majority want it increased. I argued that this apparent act of political self-destructiveness probably reflected an attempt to curry favor with wealthy donors, who are very much at odds with the general public on this issue:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pension-cutters and Privatizers, Oh My', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-08-19T14:56:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f49622e5-6345-51ed-9f2a-0250004cbcbb', 'word_count': 236, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f49622e5-6345-51ed-9f2a-0250004cbcbb'}, {'abstract': 'Detonations at two churches this month, and an unexploded device at a third, caused no injuries. As for motives and suspects, the hunt continues.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/20/us/bombs-at-3-churches-in-las-cruces-new-mexico-confound-the-authorities.html', 'snippet': 'Detonations at two churches this month, and an unexploded device at a third, caused no injuries. As for motives and suspects, the hunt continues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAS CRUCES, N.M. — Two homemade bombs exploded early this month during busy Sunday services at Roman Catholic and Baptist churches here, while a third, undetonated explosive was discovered on Friday near a leaking sprinkler valve at a Presbyterian church, fueling unease in this placid city in southern New Mexico, the second largest in the state.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/us/20BOMBWEB/20BOMBWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 351, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/19/us/20BOMBWEB/20BOMBWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 351}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/us/20BOMBWEB/20BOMBWEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 598, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/us/20BOMBWEB/20BOMBWEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1197, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/us/20BOMBWEB/20BOMBWEB-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/19/us/20BOMBWEB/20BOMBWEB-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/19/us/20BOMBWEB/20BOMBWEB-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bombs at 3 Churches in Las Cruces, New Mexico, Confound the Authorities', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker