abd3fdcce1'}, {'abstract': 'Last season, only half of the 32 N.F.L. teams used the same starting quarterback in all 16 regular-season games. And the teams with quarterback problems often seem to have them year after year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/20/sports/football/backup-quarterbacks-can-become-plan-a-awfully-fast.html', 'snippet': 'Last season, only half of the 32 N.F.L. teams used the same starting quarterback in all 16 regular-season games. And the teams with quarterback problems often seem to have them year after year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'N.F.L. teams are completing their depth charts, but for the most part, they know who will be the starting quarterback, the most important slot.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/20/sports/QUARTERBACKS-1/QUARTERBACKS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/20/sports/QUARTERBACKS-1/QUARTERBACKS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 407}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/20/sports/QUARTERBACKS-1/QUARTERBACKS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 695, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/20/sports/QUARTERBACKS-1/QUARTERBACKS-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1389, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/20/sports/QUARTERBACKS-1/QUARTERBACKS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/20/sports/Q