s/football/eli-manning-discounts-report-he-wants-to-be-nfls-highest-paid-player.html', 'snippet': 'Manning, who is in the last year of his current Giants contract, with a base salary of $17 million, said that neither he nor his agent had made such a demand.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — In a rare display of annoyance, Eli Manning on Wednesday disputed a report that he wanted to be the N.F.L.’s highest-paid player. Manning, who is negotiating a new contract with the Giants, said that neither he nor his agent had made such a demand.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Eli Manning Disputes Report That He Wants to Be N.F.L.’s Highest-Paid Player', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Eli Manning Denies Report That He Wants Richest Deal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Eli', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wages and Salaries', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NFL Network', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-19T22:25:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Pennington', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pennington', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef3aae9a-05b4-5a22-9218-f1c6d111e479', 'word_count': 317, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef3aae9a-05b4-5a22-9218-f1c6d111e479'}, {'abstract': 'An analysis of data on more than 600,000 people is the largest study thus far of the relationship between working hours and cardiovascular health.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/19/researchers-link-longer-work-hours-and-stroke-risk/', 'snippet': 'An analysis of data on more than 600,000 people is the largest study thus far of the relationship between working hours and cardiovascular health.', 'lead_paragraph': 'People who work 55 hours or more per week have a 33 percent greater risk of stroke and a 13 percent greater risk of coronary heart disease than those working standard hours, researchers reported on Wednesday in the Lancet.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-risks/well-risks-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 215, 'width': 215, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-risks/well-risks-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 215, 'width': 215, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-risks/well-risks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-risks/well-risks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-risks/well-risks-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Researchers Link Longer Work Hours and Stroke Risk', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Study Links Stroke Risk and Length of Workweek', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value'