ective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/20/1965-auschwitz-judge-weeps/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Judge Hans Hofmeyer weeps as the Auschwitz trial comes to an end in 1965.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRANKFURT\xa0— Twenty months to the day after it started, Germany’s marathon Auschwitz trial came to an end this afternoon in a highly emotional heart-gripping tone. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1965: Auschwitz Judge Weeps', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Holocaust and the Nazi Era', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-20T16:07:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8f6ae8af-221e-5095-bde6-daff51fb91f0', 'word_count': 123, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8f6ae8af-221e-5095-bde6-daff51fb91f0'}, {'abstract': 'The photographer’s latest portrait is a departure from the swinging ’60s images he’s known for.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/20/t-magazine/david-bailey-tods-handbag-photograph.html', 'snippet': 'The photographer’s latest portrait is a departure from the swinging ’60s images he’s known for.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The prolific photographer David Bailey, known for capturing the likes of the Beatles and Andy Warhol in the ’60s, turned his lens recently to an inanimate subject: the classic leather Tod’s Cape Bag. “Tod’s asked me to imagine the bag in whatever way I wanted,” says Bailey, whose summer photo exhibition, “Stardust,” was sponsored by the Italian house. “For the first time in my career, a bag is the lead character in my work. It’s not a fashion shoot, and it’s not editorial. It’s really a portrait.” Above is an exclusive first look at one of Bailey’s images, which he says “show a woman’s intimate and profound connection with this very special object.” The rest will debut online at tods.com beginning Aug. 31.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/20/t-magazine/20tods/20tods-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 899, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/20/t-magazine/20tods/20tods-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 899}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/20/t-magazine/20tods/20tods-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 684, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/20/t-magazine/20tods/20tods-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1368, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/20/t-magazine/20tods/20tods-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/20/t-magazine/20tods/20tods-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/20/t-magazine/20tods/20tods-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumb