ne}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3813c6a5-f0ec-50d0-9bcc-6b1cdc2231a7', 'word_count': 692, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3813c6a5-f0ec-50d0-9bcc-6b1cdc2231a7'}, {'abstract': 'The restaurant, which has been popular since it opened in 2006, offers generous main courses that are ideal for sharing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/23/nyregion/review-axia-taverna-in-tenafly-is-home-to-old-school-greek-dishes.html', 'snippet': 'The restaurant, which has been popular since it opened in 2006, offers generous main courses that are ideal for sharing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The scene at Axia Taverna is so lively that it’s easy to forget that the mood in Greece — the country that inspired the restaurant’s cuisine and relaxed, joyous atmosphere — is probably more strained because of the current economic crisis. Everyone at Axia, including staff members, many of whom are from the Mediterranean country, seems to be in celebration mode. The crowds of regulars coming through the oversize wooden front door and the lively traditional music add to the energy.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23DINENJ_COMBO/23DINENJ_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 242, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23DINENJ_COMBO/23DINENJ_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 242}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23DINENJ_COMBO/23DINENJ_COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 413, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23DINENJ_COMBO/23DINENJ_COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 826, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23DINENJ_COMBO/23DINENJ_COMBO-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23DINENJ_COMBO/23DINENJ_COMBO-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23DINENJ_COMBO/23DINENJ_COMBO-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Axia Taverna in Tenafly Is Home to Old-School Greek Dishes', 'kicker': 'Dining | Tenafly', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dishes Like the Ones Yaya Made', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tenafly (NJ)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Axia Taverna (Tenafly, NJ, Restaurant)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-20T23:50:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shivani Vora', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shivani', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vora', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b2c3e29d-bdca-5cf9-8dd3-5a2e5b6fe461', 'word_count': 693, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b2c3e29d-bdca-5cf9-8dd3-5a2e5b6fe461'}, {'abstract': 'Prosecutors on Thursday filed corruption charges against Eduardo Cunha, the speaker of the lower house of Congress and one of Brazil’s most powerful political figures.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/21/world/americas/brazil-house-speaker-is-charged.html', 'snippet': 'Prosecutors on Thursday filed corruption charges against Eduardo Cunha, the speaker of the lower house of Congress and one of Brazil’s most powerful political figures.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Prosecutors on Thursday filed corruption charges against Eduardo Cunha, the speaker of the lower house of Congress and one of Brazil’s most powerful political figures. Investigators said that Mr. Cunha, 56, a conservative evangelical Christian radio commentator who broke from President Dilma Rousseff’s governing coalition, was involved in a money-laundering operation that was part of a graft scheme at Petrobras, the national oil company. His problems intensified in July when a consultant for a Petrobras contractor testified that Mr. Cunha had solicited and accepted a $5 million bribe. Mr. Cunha says that he is innocent and that he will remain in his post. The Supreme Court will decide whether he will stand trial. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Brazil: House Speaker Is Charged', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Americas; Brazil: House Speaker Is Charged', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romero, Simon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brazil', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunha, Eduardo Consentino da (1958- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Petroleo Brasileiro SA Petrobras', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-20T23:53:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Simon Romero', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Simon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Romero', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/a9f55a76-c2cb-5ada-aad9-931b426598da', 'word_count': 113, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a9f55a76-c2cb-5ada-aad9-931b426598da'}, {'abstract': 'The nearly naked “desnudas” are just the latest incarnation of the subversive go-getter, an element integral to New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/23/nyregion/the-painted-ladies-of-times-square-are-part-of-an-old-new-york-tradition.html', 'snippet': 'The nearly naked “desnudas” are just the latest incarnation of the subversive go-getter, an element integral to New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One Saturday afternoon this past winter, when my family and I were having lunch at the Metropolitan Museum of Art during a ritual viewing of mummies and armor with our 5-year-old son, I noticed a young man a few tables away staring at us. He had a notebook and began to sketch; he drew intensely and quickly. I was flattered and vaguely unsettled; he looked like someone in a Todd Solondz movie perhaps up to something not entirely sane. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23BIG/23BIG-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23BIG/23BIG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23BIG/23BIG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 746, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'super