49ac'}, {'abstract': 'More Cosby accusers tell their stories in a news conference Thursday.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/20/two-new-cosby-accusers-step-forward-in-new-york/', 'snippet': 'More Cosby accusers tell their stories in a news conference Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two new accusers came forward on Thursday to add their names to the list of women with allegations of drugging or sexual assault against the entertainer Bill Cosby. They spoke at a news conference in New York held by the lawyer Gloria Allred, who is representing more than 20 other Cosby accusers.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/arts/20ALLRED/20ALLRED-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/23/arts/20ALLRED/20ALLRED-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/arts/20ALLRED/20ALLRED-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/arts/20ALLRED/20ALLRED-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/arts/20ALLRED/20ALLRED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/23/arts/20ALLRED/20ALLRED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/arts/20ALLRED/20ALLRED-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Two New Cosby Accusers Step Forward in New York', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'More Accusations Against Cosby', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Allred, Gloria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cosby, Bill', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-21T00:03:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Graham Bowley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Graham', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bowley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/428a4570-c7c5-5088-aa87-c74d9a4e3719', 'word_count': 526, 'uri': 'nyt://article/428a4570-c7c5-5088-aa87-c74d9a4e3719'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Brosnan plays a womanizing college professor who impregnates a student (Jessica Alba) and then connects with her sister (Salma Hayek) after she dumps him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/21/movies/review-some-kind-of-beautiful-stars-pierce-brosnan-as-a-serial-seducer.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Brosnan plays a womanizing college professor who impregnates a student (Jessica Alba) and then connects with her sister (Salma Hayek) after she dumps him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The execrable romantic comedy “Some Kind of Beautiful” is the kind of embarrassment a studio dumps into the market in August while hoping no one will notice. Directed by Tom Vaughan from a screenplay by Matthew Newman, this witless, offensively sexist farrago stars a flabby Pierce Brosnan as Richard Haig, a self-satisfied professor of English romantic poetry at Cambridge and a serial womanizer who sleeps with his students. When his latest girlfriend, Kate (Jessica