015/08/23/realestate/homes-for-sale-in-new-rochelle-new-york-and-southport-connecticut.html', 'snippet': 'This week’s properties include a beach house in New Rochelle, N.Y., and a Tudor in Southport, Conn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Click on the slide show to see this week’s featured properties in the New York region:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Homes for Sale in New York and Connecticut', 'kicker': 'On the Market', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Rochelle (NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Southport (Conn)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-21T15:50:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michelle Higgins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michelle', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Higgins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6ef081a3-c3d2-5ade-b437-f5d60c782536', 'word_count': 94, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6ef081a3-c3d2-5ade-b437-f5d60c782536'}, {'abstract': 'In the one-woman play by Mark St. Germain, sex therapy may be the least interesting part of an amazing life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/23/nyregion/review-becoming-dr-ruth-in-stony-point-is-a-meditation-on-home.html', 'snippet': 'In the one-woman play by Mark St. Germain, sex therapy may be the least interesting part of an amazing life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Five countries, three husbands, four names. The one most people know her by, Dr. Ruth, has become synonymous with frank talk about sex, but in “Becoming Dr. Ruth,” the first-rate Mark St. Germain play now at Penguin Rep in Stony Point, sex is perhaps the least scintillating of the subjects under discussion. This 90-minute, one-woman show, set in 1997, finds our heroine, born Karola Ruth Siegel in 1928, preparing to move from the New York apartment she has shared with Fred Westheimer for 36 years. ', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23ARTSWE1ALT/23ARTSWE1-1439929139727-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23ARTSWE1ALT/23ARTSWE1-1439929139727-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23ARTSWE1ALT/23ARTSWE1-1439929139727-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23ARTSWE1ALT/23ARTSWE1-1439929139727-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23ARTSWE1ALT/23ARTSWE1ALT-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23ARTSWE1ALT/23ARTSWE1ALT-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/nyregion/23ARTSWE1ALT/23ARTSWE1ALT-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Becoming Dr. Ruth’ in Stony Point Is a Medita