asse among the four main political parties.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/22/world/europe/president-erdogan-of-turkey-to-call-for-new-election.html', 'snippet': 'After no deal emerged from weeks of talks, President Recep Tayyip Erdogan said he would call a Nov. 1 vote to break the impasse among the four main political parties.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISTANBUL — President Recep Tayyip Erdogan of Turkey said on Friday that he would call a snap election for Nov. 1 to break the impasse among the country’s four main political parties, an impasse that opponents say is partly of his own making.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'President Erdogan of Turkey to Call for New Election', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'President of Turkey Plans to Call New Election', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Erdogan, Recep Tayyip', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yeginsu, Ceylan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice and Development Party (Turkey)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-21T18:43:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ceylan Yeginsu', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ceylan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yeginsu', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0bc195ce-3e14-5b9f-b8c8-05aec63f6f64', 'word_count': 527, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0bc195ce-3e14-5b9f-b8c8-05aec63f6f64'}, {'abstract': 'Two advisers in N