ment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carson, Benjamin S', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Rick', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rubio, Marco', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanders, Bernard', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walker, Scott K', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Planned Parenthood Federation of America', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-21T19:41:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By First Draft', 'person': [{'firstname': 'First', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Draft', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8173358e-f538-5a50-806e-2a86c7ce4632', 'word_count': 1, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8173358e-f538-5a50-806e-2a86c7ce4632'}, {'abstract': 'T’s Women’s Fashion issue is rife with stories about transformation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/21/t-magazine/editor-letter-new-day.html', 'snippet': 'T’s Women’s Fashion issue is rife with stories about transformation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IT SEEMS ONLY FITTING that an issue kicking off the fall season should be rife with stories about transformation. Yet while it wasn’t actually our intention to thread together features on that theme, neither is it really a coincidence. Change — whether emotional, sartorial, intellectual, artistic or stylistic — is what this magazine seeks to understand and to celebrate. And so, a small sampling of what lies ahead: a renegade collective that is shifting the practice and conception of architecture from a focus on the grandeur of a building to its actual everyday use; an artist who turns the stuff of daily life (which is more compelling than most, as she collects male muses and creates avatars to reproduce her Internet sex chats) into challenging work; a successful garden designer who wanted to bust out of his formal clipped-hedge-and-boxwood box and apprenticed himself at one of England’s most revered flower gardens; a group of avant-garde young designers who are reimagining fashion: luxury and craftsmanship take on a different meaning when they involve slicing and reweaving T-shirts bought in bulk at Kmart; a foreign-born press that is turning artfully designed books of fiction into status symbols.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '104', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/t-magazine/23womens-edletter/23womens-edletter-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 588, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/23/t-magazine/23womens-edletter/23womens-edletter-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 588}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/t-magazine/23womens-edletter/23womens-edletter-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1004, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/t-magazine/23womens-edletter/23womens-edletter-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1961, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/t-magazine/23womens-edletter/23womens-edletter-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/23/t-magazine/23womens-edletter/23womens-edletter-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/23/t-magazine/23womens-edletter/23womens-edletter-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Day', 'kicker': 'Editor’s Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A New Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-08-21T19:44:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deborah Needleman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deborah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Needleman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9268d5ed-8d68-52b1-9a22-5cf306e4e03a', 'word_count': 329, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9268d5ed-8d68-52b1-9a22-5cf306e4e03a'}, {'abstract': 'A molded rubber bag, designed by Robert Verdi and the Great Bag Co., mixes style details from the Birkin and Kelly bags from Hermès and is a hit of the summer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/23/fashion/bill-cunningham-it-bag.html', 'snippet': 'A molded rubber bag, designed by Robert Verdi and the Great Bag Co., mixes style details from the Birkin and Kelly bags from Hermès and is a hit of the summer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A molded rubber bag, designed by Robert Verdi and the Great Bag Co., mixes style details from the Birkin and Kelly bags from Hermès and is a hit of the summer. At $120, the bag is offered in vibrant primary colors, plus black, gray and white. A young man was observed this month on his way to work, carrying the bag in a different color on different days. Another young manwas seen with black and gray versions. Several times, 