 ended in a brief but dramatic thunder shower with many of the more than 20,000 participants taking cover under their picnic blankets.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/23/fashion/evening-hours-jazz-age-lawn-party.html', 'snippet': 'For the first time, it ended in a brief but dramatic thunder shower with many of the more than 20,000 participants taking cover under their picnic blankets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The tenth annual Jazz Age lawn party on Governor’s Island concluded its two-weekend run. For the first time, it ended in a brief but dramatic thunder shower with many of the more than 20,000 participants taking cover under their picnic blankets. The original event was the idea of Michael Arenella and his Dreamland Orchestra, as part of an effort to popularize the century-old military island after its reopened as a public park.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Evening Hours | Jazz Age Lawn Party', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Evening Hours', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Governors Island (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nineteen Hundred Twenties', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-21T20:28:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Cunningham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cunningham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/52b6275b-895d-5c9e-bfdc-c5fdb5003762', 'word_count': 73, 'uri': 'nyt://article/52b6275b-895d-5c9e-bfdc-c5fdb5003762'}, {