kistan — The speaker of the Pakistani National Assembly, Sardar Ayaz Sadiq, was unseated on Saturday after an election tribunal declared that his victory in the 2013 general election was marred by irregularities. The election tribunal ordered a new election in Mr. Sadiq’s district in the eastern city of Lahore.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Speaker of Pakistan Assembly Is Removed in Election Dispute', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pakistan Muslim League-N', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pakistan Tehreek-e-Insaf', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sharif, Nawaz', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khan, Imran', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lahore (Pakistan)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-22T21:15:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Waqar Gillani', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Waqar', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gillani', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/21b1f919-52fb-5927-ba43-e63cb9259eea', 'word_count': 143, 'uri': 'nyt://article/21b1f919-52fb-5927-ba43-e63cb9259eea'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Ieng Thirith, the most powerful woman in a brutal regime and Pol Pot’s sister-in-law, was found unfit for trial in 2012 because of dementia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/23/world/asia/ieng-thirith-khmer-rouge-minister-in-cambodia-dies-at-83.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Ieng Thirith, the most powerful woman in a brutal regime and Pol Pot’s sister-in-law, was found unfit for trial in 2012 because of dementia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ieng Thirith, the sist