-year-old accidentally killed Charles Vacca with an Uzi submachine gun, the owner of Last Stop, a top tourist-oriented machine gun range, said employees still decide a child’s readiness to fire a gun.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/23/us/year-after-death-business-as-usual-at-gun-range.html', 'snippet': 'In the year since a 9-year-old accidentally killed Charles Vacca with an Uzi submachine gun, the owner of Last Stop, a top tourist-oriented machine gun range, said employees still decide a child’s readiness to fire a gun.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHITE HILLS, Ariz. — Antonio Nárdiz, a Spanish tourist from Bilbao, said he had chosen a family vacation to America for one specific reason: to fulfill his sons’ dreams of firing real machine guns. In Spain, he noted, 10-year-old Jon and 12-year-old Toni, like all other civilians, are forbidden to use automatic weapons.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/18/us/00GUNRANGEWEB1/00GUNRANGEWEB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/18/us/00GUNRANGEWEB1/00GUNRANGEWEB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/18/us/00GUNRANGEWEB1/00GUNRANGEWEB1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/18/us/00GUNRANGEWEB1/00GUNRANGEWEB1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/18/us/00GUNRANGEWEB1/00GUNRANGEWEB1-thu