t://article/13233e8c-fbd3-57b4-abb9-62036b22ecdb'}, {'abstract': 'The semi-clad marchers, who were vastly outnumbered by spectators, were not panhandlers, but were advocating the right of all women to go bare-chested if they chose.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/24/nyregion/seeking-equality-not-tips-topless-marchers-draw-a-crowd-in-manhattan.html', 'snippet': 'The semi-clad marchers, who were vastly outnumbered by spectators, were not panhandlers, but were advocating the right of all women to go bare-chested if they chose.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was not all that surprising that a march of a few dozen topless women (and fewer men) through Midtown Manhattan on a sunny Sunday afternoon would attract perhaps thousands of gawkers, bemused tourists, leering loafers, journalists and passers-by — every single one, it seemed, carrying a camera.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/24/nyregion/24TOPLESS/24TOPLESS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/24/nyregion/24TOPLESS/24TOPLESS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/24/nyregion/24TOPLESS/24TOPLESS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 533, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/24/nyregion/24TOPLESS/24TOPLESS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 533, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/24/nyregion/24TOPLESS/24TOPLESS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 