, 'snippet': 'A hard-luck Beijing driver comes across a series of letters describing his past lives. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Traveling in China back in the early 1990s, I was waiting for my westbound train to take on water at a lonely halt in the Taklamakan Desert when a young Chinese woman tapped me on the shoulder, asked if I spoke English and, further, if I knew anything of Anthony Trollope. I was quite taken aback. Trollope here? A million miles from anywhere? I mumbled an incredulous, “Yes, I know a bit” — whereupon, in a brisk and businesslike manner, she declared that the train would remain at the oasis for the next, let me see, 27 minutes, and in that time would I kindly answer as many of her questions as possible about plot and character development in “The Eustace Diamonds”?', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/30/books/review/0830-BKS-Winchester/0830-BKS-Winchester-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 635, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/30/books/review/0830-BKS-Winchester/0830-BKS-Winchester-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 635}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/30/books/review/0830-BKS-Winchester/0830-BKS-Winchester-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 968, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/30/books/review/0830-BKS-Winchester/0830-BKS-Winchester-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1935, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/30/books/review/0830-BKS-Winchester/0830-BKS-Winc