s apology to Black Lives Matter demonstrators.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Asked about the Black Lives Matter movement during a Fox News appearance, Donald Trump responded, “I know nothing about it.” However, he did have some thoughts about Martin O’Malley’s apology\xa0for his response to Black Lives Matter demonstrators. “He apologized,” Mr. Trump said, “like a little baby, like a disgusting little weak pathetic baby, and that’s the problem with our country.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'No Comment Necessary: Donald Trump on Black Lives Matter', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Babies and Infants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox News Channel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-24T15:50:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editors', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editors'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b837c28c-7f33-5fbf-b75d-9a7136a9b00a', 'word_count': 60, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b837c28c-7f33-5fbf-b75d-9a7136a9b00a'}, {'abstract': 'The chief executive of Apple said business was booming in China, where the company has long laid the groundwork to reap big sales.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/25/technology/tim-cook-of-apple-seeks-to-quell-china-fears-in-email-to-jim-cramer.html', 'snippet': 'The chief executive of Apple said business was booming in China, where the company has long laid the groundwork to reap big sales.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — Last week, Jim Cramer, the boisterous host of CNBC’s “Mad Money,” had a company called Skyworks Solutions on his show. The company, a chip supplier for Apple, said its sales were strong in China, but its stock plummeted