le/9485ccc5-ac99-5689-88cf-c5d81b2208ab'}, {'abstract': 'Enjoy cereal while shopping for sneakers and clothing at Kith in Brooklyn; Kee’s Chocolates offers flavored milk; a wine store encourages sampling; and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/26/dining/kith-treats-cereal-bar.html', 'snippet': 'Enjoy cereal while shopping for sneakers and clothing at Kith in Brooklyn; Kee’s Chocolates offers flavored milk; a wine store encourages sampling; and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York has its first dedicated cereal bar. A small white-tiled alcove just inside the renovated Kith clothing and sneaker store in Brooklyn has 24 brand-name cold cereal varieties, with toppings. The cereals come packaged in single-serving Mylar bags that fit into small shoe boxes, from which the cereal can be eaten. The boxes are designed by sports figures — Andre Agassi has done the first one. There is no salad-bar-style display because the owner Ronnie Fieg does not like food out in the open. Milk, coffee and cereal-flavored soft-serve are also sold. Mr. Fieg says he has been obsessed with cereals since he was a teenager, mainly because he was not allowed to have sweet ones. Before the store opens, there is an express window to the street for cereal: Cereals from $6 with milk, ice cream from $5.50, Kith Treats, 233 Flatbush Avenue (Bergen Street), Prospect Heights, Brooklyn, 347-889-6114, kithnyc.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/26/dining/26BURNER1/26BURNER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/26/dining/26BURNER1/26BURNER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/26/dining/26BURNER1/26BURNER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/26/dining/26BURNER1/26BURNER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/26/dining/26BURNER1/26BURNER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/26/dining/26BURNER1/26BURNER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/26/dining/26BURNER1/26BURNER1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Childhood Obsession Leads to a Cereal Bar at Kith', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kith (Manhattan, NY, Retail Store)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cereals', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fieg, Ronnie', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olives', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALCOHOLIC BEVERAGES', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Kee's Chocolates (Manhattan, NY, Retailer)", 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Landsman, Gary J (1973- )', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wines', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-24T18:09:05+