//article/7b3fef14-a254-50e7-a7aa-51f5960d56cd'}, {'abstract': 'A two-million-year-old skull fragment was found in the same South African cave that turned up specimens of an early ancestor to humans in 2010.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/25/science/a-piece-of-the-earliest-baboon-ever-found.html', 'snippet': 'A two-million-year-old skull fragment was found in the same South African cave that turned up specimens of an early ancestor to humans in 2010.', 'lead_paragraph': ' A two-million-year-old skull fragment comes from the earliest baboon ever found, a new study reports. The fossil was found in Malapa, a cave in South Africa and a Unesco World Heritage site where specimens of Australopithecus sediba, an early ancestor of modern humans, were discovered in 2010.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/25/science/25OBS2/25OBS2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/25/science/25OBS2/25OBS2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 384}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/25/science/25OBS2/25OBS2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 655, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/25/science/25OBS2/25OBS2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1263, 'width': 1974, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/25/science/25OBS2/25OBS2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/25/science/25OBS