y-minded campaign with growing acerbity.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jeb Bush Takes a Cue From Donald Trump’s Playbook: Punch Back', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bush Takes a Cue From Trump&#8217;s Playbook: Punch Back', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bush, Jeb', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-25T00:58:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Barbaro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barbaro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/97faa5e3-970e-5cb9-893f-0aa19f1ed8c5', 'word_count': 917, 'uri': 'nyt://article/97faa5e3-970e-5cb9-893f-0aa19f1ed8c5'}, {'abstract': 'The cumulative toll inflicted on antiquities by militants, who destroyed a fifth-century monastery and a first-century temple recently, has reached staggering levels, archaeologists and officials say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/25/world/isis-accelerates-destruction-of-antiquities-in-syria.html', 'snippet': 'The cumulative toll inflicted on antiquities by militants, who destroyed a fifth-century monastery and a first-century temple recently, has reached staggering levels, archaeologists and officials say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — Islamic State militants have razed a fifth-century Roman Catholic monastery and