', 'word_count': 800, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c506c712-04f2-52c3-b63b-66b1cbf933d3'}, {'abstract': 'Spieth spoke to a group of young golfers in New Jersey about the lessons he had learned on the way to becoming the world’s top-ranked player at 22 years old.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/25/sports/golf/jordan-spieth-reassesses-a-career-path-from-the-top-where-time-is-short.html', 'snippet': 'Spieth spoke to a group of young golfers in New Jersey about the lessons he had learned on the way to becoming the world’s top-ranked player at 22 years old.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERSEY CITY — Four rows of young golfers, all active in local chapters of the First Tee, a youth development group, fidgeted in their seats in the midday sun. Filling out the rows behind them were grown-ups wearing belts and shirts bearing the names of some of the country’s most prestigious courses. On the dais, Paul Fireman — a founder, with his son, Dan, of one such place, Liberty National — was answering a question about personal legacies. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/25/sports/Y-GOLF/Y-GOLF-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/25/sports/Y-GOLF/Y-GOLF-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/25/sports/Y-GOLF/Y-GOLF-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/25/sports/Y-GOLF/Y-GOLF-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1124, 'width': 1687, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption':