ounded like, what it meant and what it led to. Especially, we know what pictures of it look like — or are supposed to look like. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The ’60s: In and Out of the Limelight', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Celebrities', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Caine, Michael', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Connery, Sean', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fonda, Jane', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hurn, David (1934- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Beatles, The', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-25T07:00:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Leland', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/724141a2-00d0-5014-8ee8-b570784a40cf', 'word_count': 400, 'uri': 'nyt://article/724141a2-00d0-5014-8ee8-b570784a40cf'}, {'abstract': 'Test your knowledge of the seven wonders of the ancient world by playing our crossword.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/25/student-crossword-the-seven-wonders-of-the-ancient-world/', 'snippet': 'Test your knowledge of the seven wonders of the ancient world by playing our crossword.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Test your knowledge of the seven wonders of the ancient world by playing our crossword (PDF). You can find the 