, 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mather', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f4e97cb8-53dd-5f44-8e10-e1f5cbafb301', 'word_count': 345, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f4e97cb8-53dd-5f44-8e10-e1f5cbafb301'}, {'abstract': 'Poking fun at Mr. Trump’s way of saying that he can solve seemingly intractable problems because “he’s a successful guy,” Mr. Bush called Mr. Trump’s immigration proposals impractical and unaffordable.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/08/25/jeb-bush-on-how-he-and-donald-trump-differ-over-immigration/', 'snippet': 'Poking fun at Mr. Trump’s way of saying that he can solve seemingly intractable problems because “he’s a successful guy,” Mr. Bush called Mr. Trump’s immigration proposals impractical and unaffordable.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jeb Bush offered a concise explanation Tuesday morning of how his plan to tackle illegal immigration differs from Donald Trump’s. His answer, prompted by a question from a member of the audience during a town hall in Englewood, Colo., is excerpted below:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jeb Bush on How He and Donald Trump Differ Over Immigration', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dream Act (Development, Relief and Education for Minors Act)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bush, Jeb', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colorado', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-25T16:49:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk