'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/26/dining/restaurant-review-the-clocktower-in-midtown-south.html', 'snippet': 'The Clocktower, in the New York Edition hotel, is a Stephen Starr restaurant with the English chef Jason Atherton in the kitchen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you hope dinner at the Clocktower will get you a backstage view of the ticking cogs at the top of the former Metropolitan Life Tower, forget it. The restaurant is on the second floor of the New York Edition hotel, which opened in the skyscraper at the foot of Madison Avenue in May. Marriott and Ian Schrager, who run the place, brought in the restaurateur Stephen Starr to operate the Clocktower.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Restaurant Review: The Clocktower in Midtown South', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At the Top of the Stairs, a Promise Delivered', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Midtown Area (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Atherton, Jason (1971- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Starr, Stephen', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schrager, Ian', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Clocktower, The (Manhattan, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-25T18:13:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pete Wells', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pete', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wells', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e20f7c6-f432-5a2c-aff2-d7e30b50a2e2', 'word_count': 1166, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e20f7c6-f432-5a2c-aff2-d7e