y of the five-year-old brand’s early shapes and detailing relied on nautical references. For his fall 2015 collection — which includes, for the first time, small leather goods — Davidson found himself thinking about the open road. His Accordion Wallet streamlines motorcyclists’ money-holders and the Key Lanyard resembles the hooded fobs once commonly affixed to car keys. The currant, ochre, white and cobalt blue (or “mineral”) of 1970s auto upholstery hold together the line that’s rounded out by AANDD staples, like the Pyramid Pouch, inspired by a knotted bodega bag. “It’s not a noble inspiration, but it has a good attitude that I can reinterpret in my own aesthetic,” Davidson says. “I’m always watching the way people carry things, wherever I am.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/25/t-magazine/25tmag-instore/25tmag-instore-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/25/t-magazine/25tmag-instore/25tmag-instore-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/25/t-magazine/25tmag-instore/25tmag-instore-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/25/t-magazine/25tmag-instore/25tmag-instore-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/25/t-magazine/25tmag-instore/25tmag-instore-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/25/t-magazine/25tmag-instore/25tmag-instore-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/25/t-magazine/25tmag-instore/25tmag-instore-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On the Road, in Accessories Form', 'kicker': 'In Store', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-25T20:37:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hilary Moss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hilary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/865efa17-7ae5-58bf-ad00-bc0d7029896f', 'word_count': 161, 'uri': 'nyt://article/865efa17-7ae5-58bf-ad00-bc0d7029896f'}, {'abstract': 'There is scant historical evidence that an authoritarian, undemocratic government like China’s could pull off the kinds of reforms it is being called on to make.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/26/business/economy/chinese-economy-faces-risks-from-political-instability.html', 'snippet': 'There is scant historical evidence that an authoritarian, undemocratic government like China’s could pull off the kinds of reforms it is being called on to make.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Can China pull it off?', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/26/business/26porter-web1/26porter-web1-artic