, '_id': 'nyt://article/b19f22b5-24bc-5619-b9a6-0505ccb977e7', 'word_count': 374, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b19f22b5-24bc-5619-b9a6-0505ccb977e7'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Chiwy, a Belgian nurse, was not recognized until 2011 for her bravery in saving countless American soldiers wounded in the Battle of the Bulge.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/26/world/europe/augusta-chiwy-forgotten-wartime-nurse-dies-at-94.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Chiwy, a Belgian nurse, was not recognized until 2011 for her bravery in saving countless American soldiers wounded in the Battle of the Bulge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Augusta Chiwy, a Belgian nurse whose unsung bravery in saving countless American soldiers wounded in the Battle of the Bulge was belatedly celebrated in 2011, died on Sunday near Brussels. She was 94.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/26/world/26CHIWY1-obit/26CHIWY1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 416, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/26/world/26CHIWY1-obit/26CHIWY1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 416}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/26/world/26CHIWY1-obit/26CHIWY1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/26/world/26CHIWY1-obit/26CHIWY1-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1420, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/26/world/26CHIWY1-obit/26CHIWY1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_