/4ff7a124-9bbf-5931-bbd2-b3b6644ac2c0'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, August 26, 2015.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/26/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-wednesday-august-26-2015.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, August 26, 2015.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Every time I go to a new country, I buy a SIM card and activate the Internet and download the map to locate myself. I would never have been able to arrive at my destination without my smartphone.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, August 26, 2015', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-08-26T04:02:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/0659d41c-6ed8-5313-aa14-d7115dd18f2e', 'word_count': 60, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0659d41c-6ed8-5313-aa14-d7115dd18f2e'}, {'abstract': 'This word has appeared in 24 New York Times articles in the past year', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/26/word-of-the-day-discombobulated/', 'snippet': 'This word has appeared in 24 New York Times articles in the past year', 'lead_paragraph': 'discombobulated • \\ˌdis-kəm-ˈbä-b(y)ə-ˌlat\\ • adjective', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Word of the Day + Quiz | discombobulated', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-08-26T04:03:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/154101d0-3518-52be-8131-e82e10d32400', 'word_count': 170, 'uri': 'nyt://article/154101d0-3518-52be-8131-e82e10d32400'}, {'abstract': 'The company will use its Maker Studios unit and ABC News in an ambitious international promotion of characters and toys from the coming film.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/26/business/media/big-push-by-disney-on-star-wars-merchandise.html', 'snippet': 'The company will use its Maker Studios unit and ABC News in an ambitious international promotion of characters and toys from the coming film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Disney will use Maker Studios, its embattled network of online video creators, and ABC News as part of a global promotional campaign for “Star Wars” merchandise that is unusual in its sheer ambition.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Big Push by Disney on ‘Star Wars’ Merchandise', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Walt Disney Company', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Star Wars: The Force Awakens (Movie)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Maker Studios', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC News', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-26T04:20:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooks Barnes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/75ca0ad8-f505-58cc-a08b-e6831d2f8aed', 'word_count': 335, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75ca0ad8-f505-58cc-a08b-e6831d2f8aed'}, {'abstract': 'Television highlights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/26/arts/television/whats-on-tv-wednesday.html', 'snippet': 'Television highlights.', 'lead_paragraph': '5:45 P.M. (IFC) SNAKES ON A PLANE (2006) The F.B.I. agent Neville Flynn (Samuel L. Jackson) is escorting a witness on a flight to Los Angeles to testify against the murderous gangster Eddie Kim (Byron Lawson). Kim makes sure that a lot of snakes are hidden in the plane’s cargo hold and that a pheromone is present that provokes them to attack. When the snakes slither into the cabin, Agent Flynn must leap into action. “There are snakes and smoke, giggles and shrieks, slamming edits and lots of goosy, lurch-in-your seat moments,” Manohla Dargis wrote in The New York Times. “Mostly, of course, there are snakes and Sam. At once hard-working and hardly working, Mr. Jackson turns in one of his customary performances, meaning that he glowers, barks and periodically unleashes a 13-letter epithet the way only he can.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Wednesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What&#8217;s On TV Wednesday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-26T05:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alec M. Priester', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alec', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/5af091e5-f4fc-53b3-8206-2995bf212ae5', 'word_count': 678, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5af091e5-f4fc-53b3-8206-2995bf212ae5'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on Wednesday, August 26, 2015.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/26/pageoneplus/corrections-august-26-2015.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections appearing in print on Wednesday, August 26, 2015.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRONT PAGE', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: August 26, 2015', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-08-26T05:27:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1b6d2418-9ffb-514c-8d3e-3d4106e8a369', 'word_count': 800, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1b6d2418-9ffb-514c-8d3e-3d4106e8a369'}, {'abstract': 'As Gustavo Jononovich documented, the bounty of natural resources in Latin America can sustain a community, but also destroy it through pollution and overdevelopment.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/26/in-latin-americas-rich-lands-poor-people/', 'snippet': 'As Gustavo Jononovich documented, the bounty of natural resources in Latin America can sustain a community, but also destroy it through pollution and overdevelopment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There it was, the mighty Amazon, biggest jungle on earth, more wondrous than even Sir David Attenborough could convey. And it was dying.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Latin America’s Rich Lands, Poor People', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hazardous and Toxic Substances', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Metals and Minerals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bolivia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brazil', 'rank': 5, 'major