 Tribune archives: London endures a long air raid in 1940.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/26/1940-london-bombed-in-nazi-raid/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: London endures a long air raid in 1940.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The longest air raid London has undergone during the war, lasting almost six hours last night and early today, brought a scattering of bombs in the capital area and its outskirts. Flash followed flash as one raider dropped a salvo of bombs in a London area early this morning. The raider sped away, only to return from a different point some minutes later. Buildings were damaged on the outskirts of London by another salvo of bombs. Through the early morning hours the drone of German war planes continued.\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, August 27, 1940', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1940: London Bombed in Nazi Raid', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Holocaust and the Nazi Era', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-26T13:16:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/27b84fa3-057c-5bea-9258-414126afec58', 'word_count': 97, 'uri': 'nyt://article/27b84fa3-057c-5bea-9258-414126afec58'}, {'abstract': 'Officials said a former colleague of Alison Parker and Adam Ward, a reporter and cameraman for WDBJ, shot and killed them as they broadcast live on Wednesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/27/us/wdbj7-virginia-journalists-shot-during-live-broadcast.html', 'snippet': 'Officials said a former colleague of Alison Parker and Adam Ward, a reporter and cameraman for WDBJ, shot and killed them as they broadcast live on Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROANOKE, Va. — He was a fired television reporter with a history of conflicts at work and rage apparently stoked by racial grievances. And when he sought revenge on Wednesday, gunning down two former colleagues, he used the tools of social media to ensure that his crime was broadcast live, recorded from multiple angles and posted online.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/us/VIRGINIA/VIRGINIA-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/27/us/VIRGINIA/VIRGINIA-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/us/VIRGINIA/VIRGINIA-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/us/VIRGINIA/VIRGINIA-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1105, 'width': 1666, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/us/VIRGINIA/VIRGINIA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbSta