 '_id': 'nyt://article/b8f2de27-53e0-5733-8074-2748596614fd', 'word_count': 1107, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b8f2de27-53e0-5733-8074-2748596614fd'}, {'abstract': 'On the roadside in Center Moriches, entered through a yawning shark’s mouth, Atlantic Seafood Restaurant and Fish Market offers a bounty of good will.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/30/nyregion/a-toothy-welcome-to-a-family-fish-restaurant-on-long-island.html', 'snippet': 'On the roadside in Center Moriches, entered through a yawning shark’s mouth, Atlantic Seafood Restaurant and Fish Market offers a bounty of good will.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Heading out toward eastern Long Island, just before the patina of the Hamptons’ wealth starts to emerge, the Montauk Highway slips past quaint hamlets and faded farmhouses and watery fingers of Moriches Bay. On the roadside in Center Moriches, through a yawning shark’s mouth, Atlantic Seafood Restaurant and Fish Market offers a bounty from the sea — to eat in, take out or prepare at home — but the main attraction is the welcoming feel of the place, orchestrated by the establishment’s owner, Dennis Donovan, a local for 50 years.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Toothy Welcome to a Family Fish Restaurant on Long Island', 'kicker': 'Neighborhood Joint', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In the Belly of the Beast', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Center Moriches (NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Seafood', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Donovan, Dennis F (1958- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlantic Seafood Restaurant and Fish Market (Center Moriches, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-26T14:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article',