: 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: A Parisian service girl is murdered by her rival in 1890.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A dramatic murder was committed last evening on the boulevard Malesherbes. The victim was Marie Guérin, a young girl in service who was to have been married on Thursday, and the murderess is a cook named Madeleine Colange. The motive of the crime, so far as it has been possible to ascertain it, seems to have been jealousy. As Marie was walking arm in arm with the young man to whom she was engaged they were accosted in front of the tramway station by her rival, who, after a few abusive words, drew a knife and with one blow stabbed her through the breast. — The New York Herald, European Edition, August 27, 1890', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/blogs/27iht-oldaug27-malesherbes/27iht-oldaug27-malesherbes-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/27/blogs/27iht-oldaug27-malesherbes/27iht-oldaug27-malesherbes-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/blogs/27iht-oldaug27-malesherbes/27iht-oldaug27-malesherbes-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 637, 'width': 969, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/blogs/27iht-oldaug27-malesherbes/27iht-oldaug27-malesherbes-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 637, 'width': 969, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/blogs/27iht-oldaug27-malesherbes/27iht-oldaug27-malesherbes-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'sub