m/2015/08/30/movies/gloria-grahame-blonde-ambition-a-film-retrospective-at-lincoln-center.html', 'snippet': 'The Film Society of Lincoln Center is presenting a 12-film retrospective featuring the actress, who specialized in playing dangerous, damaged women.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anyone who has seen Fritz Lang’s 1953 crime noir “The Big Heat” will never forget the image of Gloria Grahame, her face half-hidden behind a bandage and prosthetic makeup, playing Debby Marsh, an abused gangster’s moll. The role gave Ms. Grahame, who specialized in portraying dangerous, damaged women, one of her most pungent lines: “You’re about as romantic as a pair of handcuffs.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/30/arts/30GUIDE7/30GUIDE7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 475, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/30/arts/30GUIDE7/30GUIDE7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 475}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/30/arts/30GUIDE7/30GUIDE7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 810, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/30/arts/30GUIDE7/30GUIDE7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1621, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/30/arts/30GUIDE7/30GUIDE7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/30/arts/30GUIDE7/30GUIDE7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'ca