d a veteran in the textile business, passed away earlier this month.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/26/t-magazine/carl-apfel-in-memoriam.html', 'snippet': 'Iris Apfel’s husband of 68 years, and a veteran in the textile business, passed away earlier this month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is a moment in the film “Iris” — the recent documentary made by Albert Maysles — when Iris and Carl Apfel are interviewed together in their New York apartment. “There was something about her that just got into me; it’s always there,” says Carl of his wife of more than six decades. Iris cuts in, laughing: “And I figured he was cool, and he was cuddly, and he cooked Chinese, so I couldn’t do any better.”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Remembering Carl Apfel: A Style Icon in His Own Right', 'kicker': 'In Memoriam', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Remembering Carl Apfel', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilkinson, Isabel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Apfel, Iris', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Apfel, Carl (1914-2015)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Textiles', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-26T17:24:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Isabel Wilkinson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Isabel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilkinson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa13ffa4-b409-55a7-9a8e-ad1e9a378612', 'word_count': 739, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa13ffa4-b409-55a7-9a8e-ad1e9a378612'}, {'abstract': 'Insurers are putting greater emphasis on consumer credit 