oying-the-view-from-the-losers-circle-and-moving-on.html', 'snippet': 'In an interview, Ms. Poehler talks about the lessons she learned from “Parks and Recreation” and how she’s approaching its final chances at Emmy glory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the start of a conversation about “Parks and Recreation,” Amy Poehler said with a sentimental laugh, “Part of me is like, ‘Is this the last time I’ll ever speak of it?’ I’m getting so nostalgic about it, even though it still feels like a very present thing.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/arts/27POHLERQA/27POHLERQA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 430, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/27/arts/27POHLERQA/27POHLERQA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 430}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/arts/27POHLERQA/27POHLERQA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 734, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/arts/27POHLERQA/27POHLERQA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1469, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/arts/27POHLERQA/27POHLERQA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/27/arts/27POHLERQA/27POHLERQA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/arts/27POHLERQA/27POHLERQA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'wi