brow menu of greasy chicken and old-man cocktails, the Commodore brought a dive-bar atmosphere to a corner of Williamsburg, Brooklyn, that was on the verge of rapid change. Its owners have a similar playbook at El Cortez, a Tex-Mex bar and restaurant in Bushwick, likewise in flux. On a Sunday night in July, El Cortez was flooded with refugees from Tiki Disco nearby. As “Soul Makossa” pulsed, revelers in Nets jerseys and shades swarmed. One woman, on her back, churned her legs like an eggbeater.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/fashion/27BOITE/27BOITE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 842, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/27/fashion/27BOITE/27BOITE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 842}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/fashion/27BOITE/27BOITE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 730, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/fashion/27BOITE/27BOITE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1460, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/fashion/27BOITE/27BOITE-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/27/fashion/27BOITE/27BOITE-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/fashion/27BOITE/27BOITE-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subTyp