p aid as a way to stem the flow of refugees.', 'lead_paragraph': 'UNITED NATIONS — The new top emergency relief official here urged the world’s rich countries on Wednesday to step up aid to war zones in the Middle East and Africa so that refugees are not forced to seek safety in Europe.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.N. Says Aid Increase Would Cut Migration ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.N. Says Aid Increase Would Slow Refugee Tide ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and Africa Migrant Crisis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Brien, Stephen Rothwell (1957- )", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Humanitarian Aid', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-27T00:37:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Somini Sengupta and Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Somini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sengupta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4bef5256-2a9d-5ebc-a9d0-e95063347913', 'word_count': 597, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4bef5256-2a9d-5ebc-a9d0-e95063347913'}, {'abstract': 'The remarkable 30-minute news conference over which Mr. Trump presided in Iowa on Tuesday night crystallized his quirks and contradictions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/27/us/politics/testy-news-conference-exchange-puts-donald-trumps-quirks-on-display.html', 'snippet': 'The remarkable 30-minute news conference over which Mr. Trump presided in Iowa on Tuesday night crystallized his quirks and contradictions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was Donald J. Trump at his neediest, pleading with the television anchor in front of him to acknowledge a poll that, he said, showed that Hispanics really do love him. “You saw that, right?” he asked. “Did you see it? Wait. Did you see it?”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/us/27TRUMPweb/27TRUMPweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 377, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/27/us/27TRUMPweb/27TRUMPweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 377}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/us/27TRUMPweb/27TRUMPweb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 643, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/us/27TRUMPweb/27TRUMPweb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1286, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/27/us/27TRUMPweb/27TRUMPweb-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/27/us/27TRUMPweb/27TRUMPweb-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype