nt.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — Courts across Xinjiang, the volatile region of western China, have sentenced 45 people to prison in recent days after convicting them of supporting organizations accused of terror attacks or of helping others flee abroad, Xinhua, the main state news agency, reported on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'China Sentences 45 in Restive Region of Xinjiang', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'World Briefing | Asia; China: 45 Are Imprisoned in Xinjiang', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Uighurs (Chinese Ethnic Group)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Xinjiang (China)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-27T13:10:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chris Buckley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buckley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e72ad14a-ff8c-554c-8ea4-a39c6bfc57a9', 'word_count': 546, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e72ad14a-ff8c-554c-8ea4-a39c6bfc57a9'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Men rush to get married to avoid the draft in 1965.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/27/1965-marriage-mania-in-las-vegas/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Men rush to get married to avoid the draft in 1965.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW YORK — The beat-the-draft marriage mania that raged over many parts of the nation last night was best illustrated in Las Vegas, Nev., where 171 couples were married in the rush hours before midnight. By plane, bus and hot rod, the young couples poured into Las Vegas — Nevada requires neither blood test nor prewedding waiting period. In the top of their minds was one frantic thought — President Johnson’s order earlier in the day that a marriage after midnight yesterday would not exempt a man from the draft. — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, August 28, 1965', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/28/blogs/28iht-oldaug28-draft/28iht-oldaug28-draft-jumbo.png', 'height': 665, 'width': 439, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/28/blogs/28iht-oldaug28-draft/28iht-oldaug28-draft-superJumbo.png', 'height': 665, 'width': 439, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/28/blogs/28iht-oldaug28-draft/28iht-oldaug28-draft-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/28/blogs/28iht-oldaug28-draft/28iht-oldaug28-draft-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/28/blogs/28iht-oldaug28-draft/28iht-oldaug28-draft-thumbLarge-v2.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1965: Marriage Mania in Las Vegas', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': Non