', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cancel, Eric (1996- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jockeys, Drivers and Trainers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Saratoga Race Course', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cordero, Angel Jr', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-27T20:33:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Drape', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Drape', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/20b2691e-1a5a-5d5e-9530-c2301b9c7d6d', 'word_count': 1029, 'uri': 'nyt://article/20b2691e-1a5a-5d5e-9530-c2301b9c7d6d'}, {'abstract': 'With the popularity of its Costume Institute show, “China: Through the Looking Glass,” the Metropolitan Museum of Art extends its hours for the exhibition’s final weekend.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/08/27/met-announces-extended-hours-for-chinese-fashion-show/', 'snippet': 'With the popularity of its Costume Institute show, “China: Through the Looking Glass,” the Metropolitan Museum of Art extends its hours for the exhibition’s final weekend.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The long goodbye for “China: Through the Looking Glass” just got a little longer: The Metropolitan Museum of Art is extending hours for the exhibition’s final weekend. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/30/arts/27CHINA/27CHINA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/30/arts/27CHINA/27CHINA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, '