ng near the student union killed a student, said the university, which urged witnesses to come forward with information.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/29/us/savannah-state-university-placed-on-lockdown-after-shooting-on-campus.html', 'snippet': 'A shooting near the student union killed a student, said the university, which urged witnesses to come forward with information.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Officials are investigating the death of a student in a shooting Thursday night at Savannah State University in Georgia, the university said in a statement.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Student Dies After Savannah State University Shooting', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'National Briefing | South; Georgia: Student Killed on Campus', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rogers, Katie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stack, Liam', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'School Shootings and Armed Attacks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Savannah State University', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Savannah (Ga)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-28T04:36:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liam Stack and Katie Rogers', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Katie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rogers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization