95, 'uri': 'nyt://article/046e7577-947f-554e-a716-f464a4b37164'}, {'abstract': 'The agreement “was by no means something achieved on the negotiating table,” North Korea’s official news media quoted the country’s leader as saying.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/29/world/asia/kim-jong-un-says-norths-military-muscle-made-korean-deal-possible.html', 'snippet': 'The agreement “was by no means something achieved on the negotiating table,” North Korea’s official news media quoted the country’s leader as saying.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEOUL, South Korea — The North Korean leader, Kim Jong-un, in his first public comments on the recent deal struck with South Korea to defuse border tensions, said leverage provided by the North’s nuclear arms program had made the “landmark” agreement possible, Pyongyang’s official news media reported on Friday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/29/world/29NORTHKOREA/29NORTHKOREA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/29/world/29NORTHKOREA/29NORTHKOREA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/29/world/29NORTHKOREA/29NORTHKOREA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/29/world/29NORTHKOREA/29NORTHKOREA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/29/world/29NORTHKOREA/29NORTHKOREA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, '