e/f94775bd-d81a-58d3-bdb0-533de04a903c'}, {'abstract': 'Two readers call for America to finally take action against gun violence after the latest shooting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/28/opinion/calls-for-gun-control-after-shooting-of-tv-broadcasters.html', 'snippet': 'Two readers call for America to finally take action against gun violence after the latest shooting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Calls for Gun Control After Shooting of TV Broadcasters', 'kicker': 'Letters', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Another Gun Tragedy: ‘Have We Learned Anything?’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Roanoke (Va)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-28T07:20:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/dcd48c75-ab0a-51d8-acfb-6705ed0b989c', 'word_count': 375, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dcd48c75-ab0a-51d8-acfb-6705ed0b989c'}, {'abstract': 'The donors carrying the Bernie Sanders campaign are a refreshing break from the egregious money bundlers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/28/opinion/bernie-sanderss-small-beer-donors-in-the-big-money-casino.html', 'snippet': 'The donors carrying the Bernie Sanders campaign are a refreshing break from the egregious money bundlers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a measure of democracy, one of the more encouraging statistics of the 2016 presidential race is the fact that the average contribution to the long-shot campaign of Senator Bernie Sanders is $31.30. It would be hard to buy any politician for $31.30. That is exactly the message Mr. Sanders intends, in renouncing fat-cat, super PAC campaigning that is turning American politics into an exercise in plutocracy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/28/opinion/28fri3web/28fri3web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/28/opinion/28fri3web/28fri3web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/28/opinion/28fri3web/28fri3web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/28/opinion/28fri3web/28fri3web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/28/opinion/28fri3web/28fri3web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/28/opinion/28fri3web/28fri3web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/28/opinion/28fri3web/28fri3web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bernie Sanders’s Small-Beer Donors in the Big Money Casino', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bernie Sanders’s Small-Beer Donors', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanders, Bernard', '