alues comfort in attire above all else and has never paid any attention to the strange, mercurial shifts in fashion. But two years ago, Lonergan’s mail order Birkenstock’s repair business doubled in orders overnight. For years, orders had come from Vermont, Maine, New Hampshire and Florida, but suddenly, return labels increasingly sported ZIP codes in New York and California. Women sent in pairs they’d worn at college in the ’90s and wanted to refurbish; millennials mailed damaged, rare styles they’d found on eBay.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/28/t-magazine/28tmag-fashion-slide-UUDG/28tmag-fashion-slide-UUDG-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/28/t-magazine/28tmag-fashion-slide-UUDG/28tmag-fashion-slide-UUDG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/28/t-magazine/28tmag-fashion-slide-UUDG/28tmag-fashion-slide-UUDG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/28/t-magazine/28tmag-fashion-slide-UUDG/28tmag-fashion-slide-UUDG-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/28/t-magazine/28tmag-fashion-slide-UUDG/28tmag-fashion-slide-UUDG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/28/t-magazine/28tmag-fashion-slide-UUDG/28tmag-fashion-slide-UUDG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnail