': 'Hambone Opera in Trenton and Big Harlie’s Barbecue in Sayreville are aiming to make a name for barbecue in the Garden State.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/30/nyregion/new-jersey-barbecue-joints-find-their-secret-in-the-smoke.html', 'snippet': 'Hambone Opera in Trenton and Big Harlie’s Barbecue in Sayreville are aiming to make a name for barbecue in the Garden State.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What sensation the word barbecue evokes depends on the region you have in mind. Texas barbecue summons the smell of mesquite smoke, the brawn of beef. Think North Carolina and get a whiff of vinegar, the crackle of a pig on a spit. The meat may be fine in Georgia, but what I remember is those bags of sliced white bread. Now close your eyes and consider what the following phrase conjures: New Jersey barbecue.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/30/nyregion/30DINENJ2-COMBO/30DINENJ2-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/30/nyregion/30DINENJ2-COMBO/30DINENJ2-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/30/nyregion/30DINENJ2-COMBO/30DINENJ2-COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/30/nyregion/30DINENJ2-COMBO/30DINENJ2-COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/30/nyregion/30DINENJ2-COMBO/30DINENJ2-COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'heigh