v. Bill Walker ticks down the things he wants President Obama to see in visiting this vast northern state starting on Monday, and glorious glacial vistas are not at the top of the list.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/29/us/29ALASKA1/29ALASKA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/29/us/29ALASKA1/29ALASKA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/29/us/29ALASKA1/29ALASKA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/29/us/29ALASKA1/29ALASKA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/29/us/29ALASKA1/29ALASKA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/29/us/29ALASKA1/29ALASKA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/29/us/29ALASKA1/29ALASKA1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Alaska, Obama Will Be in Middle of Oil and Climate Change Battle', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Trip to Alaska, Obama Will Be in Middle of Battle Over Oil and Climate Change ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Kirk', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALASKA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walker, Bill (1951- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Offshore Drilling and Exploration', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-29T01:30:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kirk Johnson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kirk', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Johnson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2a5ef5fa-be5e-5752-97b7-1a61aebc2338', 'word_count': 1163, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2a5ef5fa-be5e-5752-97b7-1a61aebc2338'}, {'abstract': 'It needs to raise interest rates. But it’s scared of the stock market.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/29/opinion/show-some-spine-federal-reserve.html', 'snippet': 'It needs to raise interest rates. But it’s scared of the stock market.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE financial markets and the Federal Reserve Board have been playing out a tragicomedy in three acts. Here’s how it works: Initially, a flurry of news stories appear about how, a few months hence, the Fed intends to raise short-term interest rates for the first time in years. Second, the predictable market swoon, as Wall Street traders ponder the fact that the morphine drip of free money that they have been enjoying since the aftermath of the 2008 financial crisis might be pulled out of their arms. Finally, the Fed backs away from its much-overdue policy change, causing traders to rejoice and the artificially stimulated bull market in both stocks and bonds to continue. The curtain comes down, and the audience roars its approval.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Show Some Spine, Federal Reserve', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Show Some Spine, Federal Reserve', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cohan, William D', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interest Rates', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bernanke, Ben S', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quantitative Easing', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yellen, Janet L', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Summers, Lawrence H', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dalio, Raymond (1949- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dudley, William C', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-29T01:44:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By William D. Cohan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/eabdcd37-a0a6-5195-8307-a3c1d724fa18', 'word_count': 923, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eabdcd37-a0a6-5195-8307-a3c1d724fa18'}, {'abstract': 'We must treat mental illness much more aggressively.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/29/opinion/how-to-halt-the-violence-treat-mental-illness.html', 'snippet': 'We must treat me