: 'nyt://article/ac2fd38d-9d47-58e1-bc37-b430aea1c839', 'word_count': 682, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac2fd38d-9d47-58e1-bc37-b430aea1c839'}, {'abstract': 'Decriminalizing prostitution will hurt, not help, women.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/29/opinion/buying-sex-should-not-be-legal.html', 'snippet': 'Decriminalizing prostitution will hurt, not help, women.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DUBLIN — HERE in my city, earlier this month, Amnesty International’s international council endorsed a new policy calling for the decriminalization of the global sex trade. Its proponents argue that decriminalizing prostitution is the best way of protecting “the human rights of sex workers,” though the policy would apply equally to pimps, brothel-keepers and johns.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/29/opinion/29Moran/29Moran-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 873, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/29/opinion/29Moran/29Moran-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 873}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/29/opinion/29Moran/29Moran-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 704, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/29/opinion/29Moran/29Moran-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1924, 'width': 1322, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/29/opinion/29Moran/29Moran-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/29/opinion/29Moran/29Moran-thum