.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For some, the qualifying draw of the United States Open is a launching pad. For others, it is a place to land, comfortably or not, after enjoying greater heights in tennis. For 16 men and 16 women, it was a gantlet to reach the main draw. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Open Qualifiers Brave a Gantlet Into the Main Draw', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Open Qualifiers Brave a Gantlet Into the Main Draw', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bondarenko, Kateryna', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ymer, Elias (1996- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zverev, Alexander', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paul, Tommy (1997- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-29T02:06:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Rothenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rothenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/92b8d47d-0928-5813-ad6c-6745f2e95176', 'word_count': 638, 'uri': 'nyt://article/92b8d47d-0928-5813-ad6c-6745f2e95176'}, {'abstract': 'A Wall Street analyst, a car company and an overpriced stock.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/29/opinion/joe-nocera-the-tesla-cheerleader.html', 'snippet': 'A Wall Street analyst, a car company and an overpriced stock.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Do you remember when Henry Blodget first became famous?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank