 behind, said Ryan Sullivan, a spokesman for the Harris County Sheriff’s Office. The sheriff’s office later identified the deputy as Darren Goforth. The shooting took place around 9 p.m. at a busy intersection in unincorporated Harris County. Other law enforcement agencies joined the sheriff’s office in an intensive search for the gunman late Friday night. “We’re currently working to ascertain the physical description or identity of the suspect,” Mr. Sullivan said shortly before midnight.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Texas: Sheriff’s Deputy Is Fatally Shot at Gas Station', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | South', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Texas: Deputy Is Shot at Gas Station ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Montgomery, David', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attacks on Police', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Goforth, Darren H (1968-2015)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Harris County (Tex)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-29T04:11:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Montgomery', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Montgomery', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/9453ea88-15e4-58bc-8023-f3d211f20f7e', 'word_count': 114, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9453ea88-15e4-58bc-8023-f3d211f20f7e'}, {'abstract': 'Matt Harvey shut down Boston for six innings, but the Red Sox responded with a three-run seventh and went ahead for good on a 10th inning inside-the-park home run by catcher Blake Swihart.', 'web_ur