stories as in its orchestration of many stories, its sense of time and place,” Roger Greenspun wrote in The New York Times. “Although it is full of the material of fashionable nostalgia, it never exploits nostalgia.” He continued, “It is a very good movie, funny, tough, unsentimental.” The film also stars Ron Howard and Cindy Williams (together above), Richard Dreyfuss and Charles Martin Smith.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s On TV Saturday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What&#8217;s On TV Saturday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-29T05:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alec M. Priester', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alec', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/8a6b8ad2-fba5-515c-9651-3dc701ce3b9b', 'word_count': 697, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8a6b8ad2-fba5-515c-9651-3dc701ce3b9b'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, August 29, 2015.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/29/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, August 29, 2015.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It’s a scam, sir.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-08-29T05:11:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], '