th', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '3 Prominent Afghan Officials Are Killed as Taliban Strike Targets in South', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nordland, Rod', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001-14)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-29T18:24:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rod Nordland', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rod', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nordland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/876216ab-f09c-56f3-8e61-0238ddbcaaae', 'word_count': 1076, 'uri': 'nyt://article/876216ab-f09c-56f3-8e61-0238ddbcaaae'}, {'abstract': 'In middle age, the last days of August bring not just melancholy, but a sense of desolation, as of a possibility lost forever.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/30/opinion/sunday/the-summer-that-never-was.html', 'snippet': 'In middle age, the last days of August bring not just melancholy, but a sense of desolation, as of a possibility lost forever.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I NEVER went to Iceland. I suppose I should say I didn’t go to Iceland this summer — never sounds a little melodramatic, possibly terminal. It’s not as if I’ve died and all hope of ever having gone to Iceland is obviated. But for some reason this missed opportunity is causing me more than the usual, near-toxic level of regret. I’ve had a free apartment in Reykjavik on offer for several years, and somehow 