 or their swing, but this left-hander decided to start playing right-handed, and found that retraining his brain was no easy task.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/31/sports/tennis/battling-arm-injuries-a-tennis-player-changes-hands.html', 'snippet': 'Most players change their strings or their swing, but this left-hander decided to start playing right-handed, and found that retraining his brain was no easy task.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My forehand sailed deep — not just behind-the-baseline deep, but over-the-fence deep. I’ve played tennis for more than four decades, yet I was staring at my right hand as if it had never swung a racket, which was sort of true.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/openRIGHTY/openRIGHTY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 474, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/openRIGHTY/openRIGHTY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 474}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/openRIGHTY/openRIGHTY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 809, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/openRIGHTY/openRIGHTY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1618, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/openRIGHTY/openRIGHTY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/openRIGHTY/openRIGHTY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight'