: 586, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6bc43afe-3bce-514a-8fc9-b913a9194f66'}, {'abstract': 'The company opened a yearlong anniversary celebration with a program that mostly included recent works by European men.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/31/arts/dance/review-martha-graham-dancers-explore-myth-and-machismo-at-jacobs-pillow.html', 'snippet': 'The company opened a yearlong anniversary celebration with a program that mostly included recent works by European men.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BECKET, Mass. — The ghost of Ted Shawn, who turned a farm here into the Jacob’s Pillow Dance Festival and worked tirelessly to present dancing as a manly activity, might have been pleased to see a burly guy chopping wood on Thursday on the barnlike stage of the Ted Shawn Theater. Shawn might have been tickled, too, to learn that the man wielding the ax was a member of the dance troupe of his old student and partner Martha Graham.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/arts/31MARTHAGRAHAM/31MARTHAGRAHAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/31/arts/31MARTHAGRAHAM/31MARTHAGRAHAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/arts/31MARTHAGRAHAM/31MARTHAGRAHAM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/arts/31MARTHAGRAHAM/31MARTHAGRAHAM-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'ima