es.com/2015/08/31/sports/tennis/the-stress-of-the-tennis-grand-slam.html', 'snippet': 'At the U.S. Open, the pressure will be on Serena Williams to achieve a milestone that has been reached only six times — by Don Budge, Maureen Connolly, Rod Laver (twice), Margaret Court and Steffi Graf.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the days leading up to the 1969 United States Open, pressure was mounting on Rod Laver. He had won the Australian Open in grueling fashion and followed it up with victories at the French Open and Wimbledon.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/openSLAMS/openSLAMS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 804, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/openSLAMS/openSLAMS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 804}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/openSLAMS/openSLAMS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 765, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/openSLAMS/openSLAMS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1530, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/openSLAMS/openSLAMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/openSLAMS/openSLAMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/openSLAMS/openSLAMS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Stress of the Slam', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Stress of the Slam', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Waldstein, David', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Serena', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Budge, Don', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Connolly, Maureen (1934-69)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Laver, Rod', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Graf, Steffi', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Court, Margaret', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-30T21:44:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f9d89bb5-2fb1-5d2b-8042-fedc0052b634', 'word_count': 1309, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f9d89bb5-2fb1-5d2b-8042-fedc0052b634'}, {'abstract': 'Industry attempts to construct another Taylor Swift generally fizzled, but that’s no obstacle to attempts to build another Lorde.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/31/arts/music/in-lordes-wake-a-groundswell-of-female-rebels-in-pop.html', 'snippet': 'Industry attempts to construct another Taylor Swift generally fizzled, but that’s no obstacle to attempts to build another Lorde.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From a distance, this seems like a great moment for female friendship in