/article/377f01c9-92c4-57b9-a8f7-571746992c2c'}, {'abstract': 'A fan who fell from the upper deck during a Yankees-Braves game at Turner Field was honored before the teams’ next game as an investigation into his death continued.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/31/sports/baseball/braves-honor-fan-who-died-in-fall.html', 'snippet': 'A fan who fell from the upper deck during a Yankees-Braves game at Turner Field was honored before the teams’ next game as an investigation into his death continued.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — Gregory K. Murrey was a small-business owner, father and grandfather who enjoyed seeing a local blues band and the Atlanta Braves, for whom he had been a season-ticket holder for 23 years. His passion for his hometown baseball team was evident Saturday night as Murrey, 60, wearing a Braves cap, sat with two companions in the second row of the upper deck at Turner Field. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/31FAN/31FAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/31FAN/31FAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/31FAN/31FAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/31FAN/31FAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1164, 'width': 1747, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/sports/31FAN/31FAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width'