7dac142-05ee-5236-892c-e527d630b72c'}, {'abstract': 'For the cottage industry that supplies outlandish costumes, the influx of attendees means one thing: a bumper year for retailers of spandex and faux fur.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/09/01/style/at-burning-man-a-counterculture-festival-the-fashion-police-walk-the-beat.html', 'snippet': 'For the cottage industry that supplies outlandish costumes, the influx of attendees means one thing: a bumper year for retailers of spandex and faux fur.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — Glitter is a no-no. Sequins are frowned upon. Feathers were verboten, though they have still infiltrated in trims and turbans, to gnashing controversy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/us/31BURNINGMAN01/31BURNINGMAN01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/31/us/31BURNINGMAN01/31BURNINGMAN01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/us/31BURNINGMAN01/31BURNINGMAN01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/us/31BURNINGMAN01/31BURNINGMAN01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1348, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/us/31BURNINGMAN01/31BURNINGMAN01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/31/us/31BURNINGMAN01/31BURNINGMAN01-thumbStandard