ge will rule this week on Brady’s four-game suspension after the Patriots quarterback and the N.F.L. failed to work out their differences themselves.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A federal judge will rule this week on whether to lift or uphold New England Patriots quarterback Tom Brady’s four-game suspension by the N.F.L. after Brady and the league failed to reach an agreement to their seven-month standoff.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/09/01/sports/Y-BRADY/Y-BRADY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 441, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/09/01/sports/Y-BRADY/Y-BRADY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 441}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/09/01/sports/Y-BRADY/Y-BRADY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 753, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/09/01/sports/Y-BRADY/Y-BRADY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1505, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/09/01/sports/Y-BRADY/Y-BRADY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/09/01/sports/Y-BRADY/Y-BRADY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/09/01/sports/Y-BRADY/Y-BRADY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With No Settlement, Judge Will Decide Tom Brady’s Case', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Judge to Decide Brady Case This Week After Efforts Toward a Settlement Fail', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brady, Tom', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cheating', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Goodell, Roger', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARBITRATION, CONCILIATION AND MEDIATION', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berman, Richard M', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Patriots', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-31T15:32:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Belson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Belson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea3e4472-e767-54c7-9e4e-e7bf8ffefcbc', 'word_count': 551, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea3e4472-e767-54c7-9e4e-e7bf8ffefcbc'}, {'abstract': 'Before reacting to volatile markets, write down a financial plan to make sure your investment goals are aligned.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/31/your-money/one-thing-you-can-do-with-your-portfolio-right-now.html', 'snippet': 'Before reacting to volatile markets, write down a financial plan to make sure your investment goals are aligned.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the markets get scary, there’s an overwhelming temptation to do something, anything really, with our portfolios. But we know better. We all know on an intellectual level that selling during a dip is a bad idea, and the data confirms that successfully timing the market is, at the very least, highly unlikely. Yet it feels crazy to just sit in front of what feels like an oncoming train.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/business/083115bucks-carl-sketch/083115bucks-carl-sketch-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/31/business/083115bucks-carl-sketch/083115bucks-carl-sketch-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/business/083115bucks-carl-sketch/083115bucks-carl-sketch-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/business/083115bucks-carl-sketch/083115bucks-carl-sketch-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/31/business/083115bucks-carl-sketch/083115bucks-carl-sketch-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/business/083115bucks-carl-sketch/083115bucks-carl-sketch-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/business/083115bucks-carl-sketch/083115bucks-carl-sketch-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'One Thing You Can Do With Your Portfolio Right Now', 'kicker': 'Sketch Guy', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Security (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pensions and Retirement Plans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-31T15:41:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carl Richards', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carl', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Richards', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/74432210-f4cb-58a3-9414-d92bf7965e25', 'word_count': 760, 'uri': 'nyt://article/74432210-f4cb-58a3-9414-d92bf7965e25'}, {'abstract': 'Decades later, plans for Shakespeare & Company’s new space are finally realized.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/31/t-magazine/shakespeare-and-company-paris-books.html', 'snippet': 'Decades later, plans for Shakespeare & Company’s new space are finally realized.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the early 1970s, George Whitman, the late owner of the legendary Shakespeare & Company bookshop in Paris, had visitors make sketches of his dream cafe, which he intended to open in the adjacent building, if he ever managed to take it over. Unearthed after his death by his daughter, the current co-owner Sylvia Whitman, the drawings depicted a convivial meeting place with outdoor seating and books aplenty. Now, after more than 50 years of vacancy, the space next door has undergone a massive overhaul (the retro floor tiles were one of the few things preserved), complete with large windows through which the bookish set will be able to gaze at Notre Dame while snacking on literary treats such as Proustian madeleines and Salinger-inspired ‘‘Love and Squalor’’ pie.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '96', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/09/13/t-magazine/09tmag-shakespeare-t/09tmag-shakespeare-t-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 332, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/09/13/t-magazine/09tmag-shakespeare-t/09tmag-shakespeare-t-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 332}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/09/13/t-magazine/09tmag-shakespeare-t/09tmag-shakespeare-t-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 567, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/09/13/t-magazine/09tmag-shakespeare-t/09tmag-shakespeare-t-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1133, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/09/13/t-magazine/09tmag-shakespeare-t/09tmag-shakespeare-t-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/09/13/t-magazine/09tmag-shakespeare-t/09tmag-shakespeare-t-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/09/13/t-magazine/09tmag-shakespeare-t/09tmag-shakespeare-t-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Dream Parisian Cafe, Brought to Life', 'kicker': 'Books', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Shakespeare &amp; Coffee', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Book Trade and Publishing', 'rank': 1, 'majo