being linked to modern medicine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/09/01/health/midwife-mexico-chiapas.html', 'snippet': 'The Mexican state, like many poor areas, has a high death rate among mothers in childbirth. In an effort to change that, village midwives are being linked to modern medicine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chiapas, the southernmost state in Mexico, is a mix of wonder and sadness. It is home to rain forests, Mayan ruins, waterfalls, rugged highlands — and some of the country’s highest death rates among women in childbirth.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Training Midwives to Save Expectant Mothers in Chiapas', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Wiser Hands', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grady, Denise', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midwives', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Childbirth', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chiapas (Mexico)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Indigenous People', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-31T18:29:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Denise Grady', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Denise', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grady', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f93d6c94-af43-5b0d-9bdd-c60e3bbca8f5', 'word_count': 671, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f93d6c94-af43-5b0d-9bdd-c60e3bbca8f5'}, {'abstract': 'Some in Iran disputed reports that Ali Shakorirad had been arrested hours after he held a news conference thanking President Hassan Rouhani for a more open political climate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/09/01/world/middleeast/ali-shakorirad-iran-politician-reported-arrested.html', 'snippet': 'Some in Iran disputed reports that Ali Shakorirad had been arrested hours after he held a news conference thanking President Hassan Rouhani for a more open political climate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TEHRAN — Iranian security forces arrested a prominent reformist politician on Monday, hours after he held a news conference thanking President Hassan Rouhani for a more open political atmosphere, several Iranian news agencies reported.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Reformist Iranian Politician Is Said to Be Held', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Reformist Iranian Politician Is Said to Be Held', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shakorirad, Ali', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rouhani, Hassan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Treason and Sedition', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-31T18:42:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Erdbrink', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erdbrink', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dd5f0dc6-b7de-5029-87f3-5ecd8bb3df27', 'word_count': 484, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dd5f0dc6-b7de-5029-87f3-5ecd8bb3df27'}, {'abstract': 'Although overall bad debt levels remain relatively low, continued deterioration threatens to reverse years of profit growth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/09/01/business/dealbook/slowing-growth-exposes-chinese-banks-debt-debris.html', 'snippet': 'Although overall bad debt levels remain relatively low, continued deterioration threatens to reverse years of profit growth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'China’s economic slowdown is exposing the debt debris in its banking sector. Shaky credits on the balance sheets of the country’s four biggest lenders jumped by 28 percent to 592 billion renminbi ($92.8 billion) in the first half of the year. Further deterioration would send earnings growth into reverse.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Slowing Growth Exposes Chinese Banks’ Debt Debris', 'kicker': 'Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Agricultural Bank of China', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bank of China', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'China Construction Bank', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Industrial and Commercial Bank of China', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-08-31T18:43:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Thal Larsen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': 'Thal', 'lastname': 'Larsen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/db96539f-1e15-5040-8105-6dcf3b5589dc', 'word_count': 390, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db96539f-1e15-5040-8105-6dcf3b5589dc'}, {'abstract': 'The salt-and-pepper v