 she is feeling at the moment. The most recent curations have been all-summer-everything: T’s deputy editor Hanya Yanagihara and senior online editor Isabel Wilkinson each posted images of remote places in which to take a dip (hotel pools and swimming holes, respectively); art director Shawn Carney celebrated the dog days with a survey of seasonal album covers; and features associate Lauren Poggi honored summer’s finest elements through the lenses of art and photography.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/t-magazine/31tmag-instagram-slide-D3U7/31tmag-instagram-slide-D3U7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/31/t-magazine/31tmag-instagram-slide-D3U7/31tmag-instagram-slide-D3U7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/t-magazine/31tmag-instagram-slide-D3U7/31tmag-instagram-slide-D3U7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 960, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/t-magazine/31tmag-instagram-slide-D3U7/31tmag-instagram-slide-D3U7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 960, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/31/t-magazine/31tmag-instagram-slide-D3U7/31tmag-instagram-slide-D3U7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/31/t-magazine/31tmag-instagram-slide-D3U7/31tmag-instagram-slide-D3U7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 